(939889, 108439, 1845, '<td valign="top">is the light a pearly gate<br/>do poor does bar your way<br/>does this meeting come by chance<br/>or was there heavenly circumstance?<br/> <br/>Technically, this photo will probably get killed, but there is something so emotive about it, I say damn the rest.  I give you an 8, maybe a 9; I haven''t quite decided, but assume a 9.<br/> <br/>Ahh screw it.  This image done got up in my head. 10.</td>', 'is the light a pearly gatedo poor does bar your waydoes this meeting come by chanceor was there heavenly circumstance? Technically, this photo will probably get killed, but there is something so emotive about it, I say damn the rest.  I give you an 8, maybe a 9; I haven''t quite decided, but assume a 9. Ahh screw it.  This image done got up in my head. 10.', '2004-10-04 03:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
