(939893, 109797, 1845, '<td valign="top">Typically, wildlife shots at such a distance really lose their impact, but the gray layering of the trees'' vertical lines with a curious splash of squirrel (looking rather skittish) has great visual effect.  Were the entire foreground tree''s bark in focus, the image might seem too flat.<br/> <br/>10.</td>', 'Typically, wildlife shots at such a distance really lose their impact, but the gray layering of the trees'' vertical lines with a curious splash of squirrel (looking rather skittish) has great visual effect.  Were the entire foreground tree''s bark in focus, the image might seem too flat. 10.', '2004-10-04 03:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
