(939903, 109799, 1845, '<td valign="top">Ahh, exhibitionists.  I assume you have made every attempt to meet the challenge, that the building in the background is their humble abode, and they like to drive that shiny white car on the left there.  Here''s hoping all that hard work pays off (in the way of a baby, assuming they want one).<br/> <br/>10.</td>', 'Ahh, exhibitionists.  I assume you have made every attempt to meet the challenge, that the building in the background is their humble abode, and they like to drive that shiny white car on the left there.  Here''s hoping all that hard work pays off (in the way of a baby, assuming they want one). 10.', '2004-10-04 03:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
