(940352, 108672, 16739, '<td valign="top">wild ?</td>', 'wild ?', '2004-10-04 10:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(940353, 109789, 16739, '<td valign="top">looks over processed</td>', 'looks over processed', '2004-10-04 10:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(940354, 109654, 6008, '<td valign="top">Seagulls can be very tough to shoot. You''ve captured the action of the moment very well and show the erratic, desperation that usually comes when these birds are looking for food. You''ve established their environment with the beach and the rocks. The exposure looks a little off as they''re normally very bright white birds and here they look a little grey, but being slightly underexposed is better than being overexposed. In an ideal world, unless you were going for artistic impression, both birds being in focus and sharp would have better, but I still believe you have captured the mood of the moment.</td>', 'Seagulls can be very tough to shoot. You''ve captured the action of the moment very well and show the erratic, desperation that usually comes when these birds are looking for food. You''ve established their environment with the beach and the rocks. The exposure looks a little off as they''re normally very bright white birds and here they look a little grey, but being slightly underexposed is better than being overexposed. In an ideal world, unless you were going for artistic impression, both birds being in focus and sharp would have better, but I still believe you have captured the mood of the moment.', '2004-10-04 10:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(940355, 108583, 18624, '<td valign="top">I love the color of the background against this beautiful white egret</td>', 'I love the color of the background against this beautiful white egret', '2004-10-04 10:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(940356, 109298, 18624, '<td valign="top">Beautiful stop action</td>', 'Beautiful stop action', '2004-10-04 10:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(940360, 109487, 18624, '<td valign="top">Absolutly unique pose.</td>', 'Absolutly unique pose.', '2004-10-04 10:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(940362, 109648, 26500, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  I think the crop could have been a little wider.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  I think the crop could have been a little wider.', '2004-10-04 10:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(940363, 109570, 26500, '<td valign="top">Beautiful owl.  The picture could have been stronger with less noise and sharper focus imo.</td>', 'Beautiful owl.  The picture could have been stronger with less noise and sharper focus imo.', '2004-10-04 10:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(940364, 109797, 26500, '<td valign="top">Cute subject.  Interesting POV.  I think the DOF is good as well.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Cute subject.  Interesting POV.  I think the DOF is good as well.  Nice shot.', '2004-10-04 10:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(940365, 109610, 26500, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  The lighting seems a bit harsh but overall it is an interesting shot.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  The lighting seems a bit harsh but overall it is an interesting shot.', '2004-10-04 10:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(940367, 109478, 26500, '<td valign="top">Cool owl. The grey at the top of the background is distracting imo.  Perhaps an all black background would have worked better.</td>', 'Cool owl. The grey at the top of the background is distracting imo.  Perhaps an all black background would have worked better.', '2004-10-04 10:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(940368, 109347, 26500, '<td valign="top">Oh man that little fellow is cute.  A little sharper focus on the cub and this would have been perfect imo.</td>', 'Oh man that little fellow is cute.  A little sharper focus on the cub and this would have been perfect imo.', '2004-10-04 10:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(940369, 109643, 26500, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject.  I am a fan of nice, big cat photos. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful subject.  I am a fan of nice, big cat photos. Well done.', '2004-10-04 10:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(940371, 109239, 26500, '<td valign="top">Great title.  The DOF is good as well as the overall composition imo.  Very well done.</td>', 'Great title.  The DOF is good as well as the overall composition imo.  Very well done.', '2004-10-04 10:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(940372, 109503, 6008, '<td valign="top">A very sleek animal indeed. Animal shots are very similar to human shots in regards to some of the features to look out for. One thing they suggest you not do is to have the background going ''through'' the head. Another is the importance of the eyes. Eyes communicate with the viewer and as with humans, animal eyes show a lot of character. You got good even lighting, the coloration is also good, and it''s nicely sharp. I dont think the amount of background used establishes enough of a setting to be too useful and the full body pose looks a little awkward. The head is upright and alert and so I would have been inclined to zoom or crop in a little more to isolate the markings and texture.</td>', 'A very sleek animal indeed. Animal shots are very similar to human shots in regards to some of the features to look out for. One thing they suggest you not do is to have the background going ''through'' the head. Another is the importance of the eyes. Eyes communicate with the viewer and as with humans, animal eyes show a lot of character. You got good even lighting, the coloration is also good, and it''s nicely sharp. I dont think the amount of background used establishes enough of a setting to be too useful and the full body pose looks a little awkward. The head is upright and alert and so I would have been inclined to zoom or crop in a little more to isolate the markings and texture.', '2004-10-04 10:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(940373, 109452, 26500, '<td valign="top">The colors are very nice.  I would have like to have seen this with a bit larger DOF to bring the whole shot into focus.</td>', 'The colors are very nice.  I would have like to have seen this with a bit larger DOF to bring the whole shot into focus.', '2004-10-04 10:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(940375, 109710, 26500, '<td valign="top">Cool macro.  The DOF could have been deeper (hard to do with macro).  Overall this is a really cool shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Cool macro.  The DOF could have been deeper (hard to do with macro).  Overall this is a really cool shot.  Well done.', '2004-10-04 10:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(940377, 109002, 26500, '<td valign="top">DOF and lighting are great in this shot.  Well done.</td>', 'DOF and lighting are great in this shot.  Well done.', '2004-10-04 10:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(940378, 109577, 26500, '<td valign="top">Slightly faster shutter speed and this would have been perfect imo.  Still this is a great shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Slightly faster shutter speed and this would have been perfect imo.  Still this is a great shot.  Well done.', '2004-10-04 10:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(940379, 109469, 26500, '<td valign="top">Cute subject.  A different angle may have been a more interesting shot.</td>', 'Cute subject.  A different angle may have been a more interesting shot.', '2004-10-04 10:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(940382, 109511, 26500, '<td valign="top">Nicely done photo.  The natural environment aspect is somewhat lacking imo.</td>', 'Nicely done photo.  The natural environment aspect is somewhat lacking imo.', '2004-10-04 10:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(940386, 109480, 26500, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are amazing.  Very crisp.  I am guessing this will ribbon.  Well done. - 10</td>', 'The colors in this shot are amazing.  Very crisp.  I am guessing this will ribbon.  Well done. - 10', '2004-10-04 10:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(940388, 109341, 16493, '<td valign="top">is it taken through glass, looks like some reflection over the lower part of the face.<br/>Still very funny picture, good capture, migth benefitt from more postediting.</td>', 'is it taken through glass, looks like some reflection over the lower part of the face.Still very funny picture, good capture, migth benefitt from more postediting.', '2004-10-04 10:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(940390, 109308, 6008, '<td valign="top">The light and color is excellent. and your exposure is good. The details of the features are wonderful and the bird looks in focus and nicely sharp. The pose is fairly generic, which isnt a bad thing but with wildlife photography you''re always trying to capture something just a little different. I''m also not sure about the cropped feet on the foreground bird and the head crop with the background birds. The colorful reflections fill up the negative space to the left of the bird but I still get a feeling that I would rather see him isolated, a closer shot, or with more of a crowd. It''s still a good shot.</td>', 'The light and color is excellent. and your exposure is good. The details of the features are wonderful and the bird looks in focus and nicely sharp. The pose is fairly generic, which isnt a bad thing but with wildlife photography you''re always trying to capture something just a little different. I''m also not sure about the cropped feet on the foreground bird and the head crop with the background birds. The colorful reflections fill up the negative space to the left of the bird but I still get a feeling that I would rather see him isolated, a closer shot, or with more of a crowd. It''s still a good shot.', '2004-10-04 10:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(940393, 109323, 5728, '<td valign="top">Not bad, she sure looks wild. The sepia toning is fitting, I think you have dodged the eye area a little too much though.</td>', 'Not bad, she sure looks wild. The sepia toning is fitting, I think you have dodged the eye area a little too much though.', '2004-10-04 10:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(940396, 109386, 26500, '<td valign="top">Subject could have been in better focus.  The DOF could have been shallower as welll.  I found myself distracted by trying to figure out what the background was.</td>', 'Subject could have been in better focus.  The DOF could have been shallower as welll.  I found myself distracted by trying to figure out what the background was.', '2004-10-04 10:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(940398, 109323, 26500, '<td valign="top">Unique take on the challenge.  This shot reminds me of a 50s B movie.  Well done.</td>', 'Unique take on the challenge.  This shot reminds me of a 50s B movie.  Well done.', '2004-10-04 10:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(940401, 109671, 26500, '<td valign="top">Cute subject.  I like the overall compostion.  The crop could have been a tad wider to get the subject tail completely in the shot.   Well done.</td>', 'Cute subject.  I like the overall compostion.  The crop could have been a tad wider to get the subject tail completely in the shot.   Well done.', '2004-10-04 10:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(940405, 109467, 26500, '<td valign="top">I like the composition  of this shot.  Interesting lines.  It seems a bit overexposed in the top left however.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'I like the composition  of this shot.  Interesting lines.  It seems a bit overexposed in the top left however.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2004-10-04 10:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(940407, 109787, 26500, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot.  Great focus and DOF.  This reminded me of the Finding Nemo seagulls. ;D</td>', 'I really liked this shot.  Great focus and DOF.  This reminded me of the Finding Nemo seagulls. ;D', '2004-10-04 10:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(940410, 109643, 13381, '<td valign="top">What a pretty cat that is. :)</td>', 'What a pretty cat that is. :)', '2004-10-04 10:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(940411, 108464, 26500, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot I would have like to have seen this one on complexity.</td>', 'Very cool shot I would have like to have seen this one on complexity.', '2004-10-04 10:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(940412, 108898, 13381, '<td valign="top">This is awesome composition. :)</td>', 'This is awesome composition. :)', '2004-10-04 10:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(940413, 109341, 6008, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to catch an unusual moment that is also humorous, which is exactly what makes images like this stick out. The exposure is good, which is quite difficult with gorillas because they are so dark. You have good details in the face and texture in the hair. The eyes are a little dark but you''ve got the catchlights so they still communicate with the viewer. Kinda reminds me of ''see no evil, speak no evil, hear no evil''. Fun shot!</td>', 'You''ve managed to catch an unusual moment that is also humorous, which is exactly what makes images like this stick out. The exposure is good, which is quite difficult with gorillas because they are so dark. You have good details in the face and texture in the hair. The eyes are a little dark but you''ve got the catchlights so they still communicate with the viewer. Kinda reminds me of ''see no evil, speak no evil, hear no evil''. Fun shot!', '2004-10-04 10:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(940415, 109418, 26500, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the tounge and overall wonderful shot.  I would have like to have seen a bit deeper DOF to get the teeth in a little sharper focus.</td>', 'Great focus on the tounge and overall wonderful shot.  I would have like to have seen a bit deeper DOF to get the teeth in a little sharper focus.', '2004-10-04 10:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(940417, 109144, 26500, '<td valign="top">This is simply great imo.  The reflection and being able to see the feet underwater is perfect.  The only tiny thing that detracts from the photo imo is the loss of detail on the top of the birds back.  This is probably impossible to avoid anyway due to how amazingly white it is.<br/> <br/>Great Job! -9-</td>', 'This is simply great imo.  The reflection and being able to see the feet underwater is perfect.  The only tiny thing that detracts from the photo imo is the loss of detail on the top of the birds back.  This is probably impossible to avoid anyway due to how amazingly white it is. Great Job! -9-', '2004-10-04 10:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(940419, 108557, 26500, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject.  Great natural environment.  Perfect focus and DOF imo. -8-</td>', 'Beautiful subject.  Great natural environment.  Perfect focus and DOF imo. -8-', '2004-10-04 10:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(940420, 109577, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus! These guys are so difficult to get while flying and you''ve captured a very nicely exposed, sharp, and unusual shot. The color is great and the dark grey feel is very atmospheric and dramatic. Excellent details in the feathers and even in the highlights/shadows. The angle of the shot and the crop has made the wings the focus point and they do an excellent job at that. Impressive shot!</td>', 'Wonderful focus! These guys are so difficult to get while flying and you''ve captured a very nicely exposed, sharp, and unusual shot. The color is great and the dark grey feel is very atmospheric and dramatic. Excellent details in the feathers and even in the highlights/shadows. The angle of the shot and the crop has made the wings the focus point and they do an excellent job at that. Impressive shot!', '2004-10-04 10:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(940421, 109424, 26500, '<td valign="top">Cropping the shot to position the deer more off center would have helped this shot imo.  I love the background.</td>', 'Cropping the shot to position the deer more off center would have helped this shot imo.  I love the background.', '2004-10-04 10:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(940424, 109799, 26500, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I''ve ever seen this in the streets before.  Very interesting shot.</td>', 'I can''t say I''ve ever seen this in the streets before.  Very interesting shot.', '2004-10-04 10:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(940429, 109602, 26500, '<td valign="top">Interesting subjects.  Good focus and DOF.  Well done.</td>', 'Interesting subjects.  Good focus and DOF.  Well done.', '2004-10-04 10:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(940430, 109327, 17103, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot, the colors and subdued lighting are wonderful.</td>', 'A beautiful shot, the colors and subdued lighting are wonderful.', '2004-10-04 10:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(940434, 109623, 26500, '<td valign="top">Interesting subjects.  The focus could have been  bit better imo.</td>', 'Interesting subjects.  The focus could have been  bit better imo.', '2004-10-04 10:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
