(940468, 109745, 26500, '<td valign="top">It seems like a lot of detail is missing from the underside of the bird.   Possibly the effect of a high iso film or too much noise reduction.</td>', 'It seems like a lot of detail is missing from the underside of the bird.   Possibly the effect of a high iso film or too much noise reduction.', '2004-10-04 11:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
