(940897, 109454, 2716, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  The image seems flat.  I''m trying to think of how you could have given it more oomph but I have a brain cramp right now.  Stay tuned ... Jacko.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  The image seems flat.  I''m trying to think of how you could have given it more oomph but I have a brain cramp right now.  Stay tuned ... Jacko.', '2004-10-04 14:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
