(940905, 109066, 6008, '<td valign="top">An interesting image. The sunset colors are good and I like the graduation of tones. The placement of the horizon is good too, as is the placement of the giraffe in the frame also. The tree does a good job of balancing the image. I keep looking at the legs because they look so weird. It looks like one leg with a hole in the middle. It''s interesting how the mind fills in the blanks. It''s nicely sharp, although a tad oversharpened with the white halo standing out more against the black silhouette.</td>', 'An interesting image. The sunset colors are good and I like the graduation of tones. The placement of the horizon is good too, as is the placement of the giraffe in the frame also. The tree does a good job of balancing the image. I keep looking at the legs because they look so weird. It looks like one leg with a hole in the middle. It''s interesting how the mind fills in the blanks. It''s nicely sharp, although a tad oversharpened with the white halo standing out more against the black silhouette.', '2004-10-04 14:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(940912, 109743, 26500, '<td valign="top">Great macro.  The background distracts me somewhat but all around this is a nice shot.<br/> <br/>Good Job.</td>', 'Great macro.  The background distracts me somewhat but all around this is a nice shot. Good Job.', '2004-10-04 14:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
