(940938, 109734, 26500, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject.  The composition reminds me of a post card.</td>', 'Beautiful subject.  The composition reminds me of a post card.', '2004-10-04 14:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(940939, 109504, 6008, '<td valign="top">The background seems a little too busy or contrasty and so the bird blends a little. It does have a somewhat 3d feel to it after you look at it for a while but I have to say I would have preferred a different background. The focus on the goose is good, especially considering he''s flying. It also looks fairly sharp. His wings look a little blue, which is quite unusual looking.</td>', 'The background seems a little too busy or contrasty and so the bird blends a little. It does have a somewhat 3d feel to it after you look at it for a while but I have to say I would have preferred a different background. The focus on the goose is good, especially considering he''s flying. It also looks fairly sharp. His wings look a little blue, which is quite unusual looking.', '2004-10-04 14:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(940940, 109451, 26500, '<td valign="top">Good subject and interesting POV.  Focus and DOF are also great.<br/> <br/>Good job.</td>', 'Good subject and interesting POV.  Focus and DOF are also great. Good job.', '2004-10-04 14:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(940942, 109760, 26500, '<td valign="top">Good use of B&amp;W.  I think with a different crop showing less beach I would have liked the shot better.  Still a great shot.<br/> <br/>Good Job.</td>', 'Good use of B&W.  I think with a different crop showing less beach I would have liked the shot better.  Still a great shot. Good Job.', '2004-10-04 14:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(940947, 109647, 26500, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  The marsh is also a nice environment.  Good job.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  The marsh is also a nice environment.  Good job.', '2004-10-04 14:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(940948, 109143, 26500, '<td valign="top">Great texture and colors.  Focus and DOF are right on.  Nice work.</td>', 'Great texture and colors.  Focus and DOF are right on.  Nice work.', '2004-10-04 14:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(940957, 108898, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the composition, wonderful frame. Like how the gray wall and owl colors work together</td>', 'Great shot. Love the composition, wonderful frame. Like how the gray wall and owl colors work together', '2004-10-04 14:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(940968, 109043, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like what looks like aspens in the background, they add a nice background and good color that continues with the grass. The exposure is good and you can see the wonderful textures of the fur. The composition of filling the frame with the bison is good but the pose itself is rather static. It works as a profile shot showing off the frame of the bison but it just lacks some interest. It''s quite hard, especially in the wild, to find different or unusual poses of well-photographed animals.</td>', 'I like what looks like aspens in the background, they add a nice background and good color that continues with the grass. The exposure is good and you can see the wonderful textures of the fur. The composition of filling the frame with the bison is good but the pose itself is rather static. It works as a profile shot showing off the frame of the bison but it just lacks some interest. It''s quite hard, especially in the wild, to find different or unusual poses of well-photographed animals.', '2004-10-04 14:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(940969, 109591, 26500, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cats.  The focus is good and the DOF.  The shutter speed could have been a bit faster to stop all the motion without blurring.<br/> <br/>Good job.</td>', 'Beautiful cats.  The focus is good and the DOF.  The shutter speed could have been a bit faster to stop all the motion without blurring. Good job.', '2004-10-04 14:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(940971, 109795, 26500, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and good DOF.  The composition is somewhat ho-hum.  If the bird was off center or something this shot would be better imo.</td>', 'Nice subject and good DOF.  The composition is somewhat ho-hum.  If the bird was off center or something this shot would be better imo.', '2004-10-04 14:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(940972, 109389, 26500, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors.  Nice focus and DOF. <br/> <br/>great job</td>', 'beautiful colors.  Nice focus and DOF.  great job', '2004-10-04 14:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(940975, 109195, 26500, '<td valign="top">Interesting POV.  The compostion and title go together well<br/> <br/>Good job</td>', 'Interesting POV.  The compostion and title go together well Good job', '2004-10-04 14:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(940984, 109140, 24454, '<td valign="top">Sorry I don''t think so.  They are precious and adorable, and no doubt rambunctious.  But not wild.</td>', 'Sorry I don''t think so.  They are precious and adorable, and no doubt rambunctious.  But not wild.', '2004-10-04 14:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(940985, 109792, 26500, '<td valign="top">The use of lines in the photo is nice.  There seems to be quite a bit of grain prescent.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The use of lines in the photo is nice.  There seems to be quite a bit of grain prescent. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-04 14:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
