(940989, 109438, 26500, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  The reflection is a nice touch.  The lighting seems a little harsh and the composition is somewhat boring with the bird in the dead center of the frame and nothing else around.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  The reflection is a nice touch.  The lighting seems a little harsh and the composition is somewhat boring with the bird in the dead center of the frame and nothing else around. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-04 14:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
