(940994, 109793, 26500, '<td valign="top">Nice subject in a truly natural environment.  The focus is good.  The DOF could have been a little shallower to blur the background more imo.<br/> <br/>Good work.</td>', 'Nice subject in a truly natural environment.  The focus is good.  The DOF could have been a little shallower to blur the background more imo. Good work.', '2004-10-04 15:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
