(941010, 109454, 26500, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture but it says nothing about its environment to me.<br/> <br/>Interesting take on the challenge.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting texture but it says nothing about its environment to me. Interesting take on the challenge. Good luck.', '2004-10-04 15:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
