(941095, 109545, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice image and colors. I would crop it tighter... backside cuz there is some distracting light reflections on water and right side cuz something is swimming there :). I think image wouldnt loose much from that.</td>', 'Nice image and colors. I would crop it tighter... backside cuz there is some distracting light reflections on water and right side cuz something is swimming there :). I think image wouldnt loose much from that.', '2004-10-04 15:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(941114, 109663, 27524, '<td valign="top">Wow...fantastic water! Rocks are nice too but these greens doesnt fit that well.</td>', 'Wow...fantastic water! Rocks are nice too but these greens doesnt fit that well.', '2004-10-04 15:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(941122, 109789, 21124, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I do not like the processing.</td>', 'Sorry, but I do not like the processing.', '2004-10-04 15:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(941135, 109789, 6388, '<td valign="top">neat image (or whatever noise reduction program you used) destroyed the details in the highlights.  NI and and similar programs need to be used judiciously, and in conjunction with sharpening (only in the full version of NI) to get the real value.<br/>Despite that, this image is pretty cool, and will make a nice print if you choose to do so...it has an ethereal quality to it...a halo of sorts.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'neat image (or whatever noise reduction program you used) destroyed the details in the highlights.  NI and and similar programs need to be used judiciously, and in conjunction with sharpening (only in the full version of NI) to get the real value.Despite that, this image is pretty cool, and will make a nice print if you choose to do so...it has an ethereal quality to it...a halo of sorts.  good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-04 15:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(941139, 109647, 27524, '<td valign="top">:) Thats wild and wet... nice capture. I wonder about upper dark part...if there would be more of these dark blured bushes it would be good contrast with white of bird.</td>', ':) Thats wild and wet... nice capture. I wonder about upper dark part...if there would be more of these dark blured bushes it would be good contrast with white of bird.', '2004-10-04 15:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(941143, 109605, 6388, '<td valign="top">sweet.  was this little guy actually blue or was that hue shifting at play?  selective desaturation is nowhere near my favourite technique, but works well enough here.  in fact he might have disappeared without it, so no deductions from me :)  nice job.</td>', 'sweet.  was this little guy actually blue or was that hue shifting at play?  selective desaturation is nowhere near my favourite technique, but works well enough here.  in fact he might have disappeared without it, so no deductions from me :)  nice job.', '2004-10-04 15:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(941148, 109487, 27524, '<td valign="top">:) Thats some hunter watching not to be hunted himself.</td>', ':) Thats some hunter watching not to be hunted himself.', '2004-10-04 15:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(941151, 109756, 6388, '<td valign="top">this is clearly the best direction he could have been facing for this shot.  colours seem a little flat (maybe a little overexposure to keep the details in the bear?), but i like it other than that.  7</td>', 'this is clearly the best direction he could have been facing for this shot.  colours seem a little flat (maybe a little overexposure to keep the details in the bear?), but i like it other than that.  7', '2004-10-04 15:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(941156, 109518, 27524, '<td valign="top">First i thought nothing special but it is special. It looks so real...fantastic focus specially on that gray misty background. And colors are lovely too.</td>', 'First i thought nothing special but it is special. It looks so real...fantastic focus specially on that gray misty background. And colors are lovely too.', '2004-10-04 15:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(941161, 108890, 22689, '<td valign="top">Really nice ! I like the composition !</td>', 'Really nice ! I like the composition !', '2004-10-04 15:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(941165, 109386, 27524, '<td valign="top">Tighter focus would made it much better and blurry bacground too i guess. But good try.</td>', 'Tighter focus would made it much better and blurry bacground too i guess. But good try.', '2004-10-04 15:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(941170, 108812, 27524, '<td valign="top">Quality is good but would like to see more action in it.</td>', 'Quality is good but would like to see more action in it.', '2004-10-04 15:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(941172, 109361, 27524, '<td valign="top">Is she/he flirting? ;)</td>', 'Is she/he flirting? ;)', '2004-10-04 15:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(941177, 108464, 18197, '<td valign="top">Subject must be very well camoflaged. I don''t see the wildlife.</td>', 'Subject must be very well camoflaged. I don''t see the wildlife.', '2004-10-04 15:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(941178, 109323, 27524, '<td valign="top">All we are from same forest :). Good quality shot and nice use of sepia.</td>', 'All we are from same forest :). Good quality shot and nice use of sepia.', '2004-10-04 15:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(941180, 109511, 18197, '<td valign="top">Natural habitat? Doesn''t meet challenge.</td>', 'Natural habitat? Doesn''t meet challenge.', '2004-10-04 15:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(941181, 109670, 27524, '<td valign="top">:) The play of sunlight is real nice...and color of water. Pitty you had to take such tight crop.</td>', ':) The play of sunlight is real nice...and color of water. Pitty you had to take such tight crop.', '2004-10-04 15:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(941183, 109140, 18197, '<td valign="top">Non-domesticated mammels? Doesn''t meet challenge. Nice picture though!</td>', 'Non-domesticated mammels? Doesn''t meet challenge. Nice picture though!', '2004-10-04 15:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(941186, 109673, 18197, '<td valign="top">Subject must be well camoflaged. Don''t see any wildlife. Nice photo though.</td>', 'Subject must be well camoflaged. Don''t see any wildlife. Nice photo though.', '2004-10-04 15:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(941189, 109756, 27524, '<td valign="top">Lovely scenario... bear and rocks... Those trees look like flowers with bright tops :). Sure would like to see bears front but i guess he better goes then cames ;).</td>', 'Lovely scenario... bear and rocks... Those trees look like flowers with bright tops :). Sure would like to see bears front but i guess he better goes then cames ;).', '2004-10-04 15:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(941192, 109788, 27524, '<td valign="top">King at rest. Long for some sunlight on it to make it brighter but overall well done.</td>', 'King at rest. Long for some sunlight on it to make it brighter but overall well done.', '2004-10-04 15:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(941195, 109323, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to come up with the name of this species ... non-domesticated mammel who''s natural environment is under a bridge ... I''m sure it has to have a name because the species would be on the endangered list.<br/> <br/>All kidding aside, very nice photo. Eyes are arresting. Composition''s fine. Technical details are very good. Creative capture. And I''ll bet your model cleans up well. Very pretty under the grime. Nice job even if the tie in to the challenge is a little thin.</td>', 'I''m trying to come up with the name of this species ... non-domesticated mammel who''s natural environment is under a bridge ... I''m sure it has to have a name because the species would be on the endangered list. All kidding aside, very nice photo. Eyes are arresting. Composition''s fine. Technical details are very good. Creative capture. And I''ll bet your model cleans up well. Very pretty under the grime. Nice job even if the tie in to the challenge is a little thin.', '2004-10-04 15:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(941196, 109593, 27524, '<td valign="top">People, where are you going to get such! :) Wet tree and streeming water is excelent.</td>', 'People, where are you going to get such! :) Wet tree and streeming water is excelent.', '2004-10-04 16:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(941198, 108434, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pretty abstract for my taste. Soft focus and muddy colors make it hard for me resonate with this.</td>', 'Pretty abstract for my taste. Soft focus and muddy colors make it hard for me resonate with this.', '2004-10-04 16:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(941199, 109571, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lost a little focus on the head. The halo is distracting. Otherwise a nice capture.</td>', 'Lost a little focus on the head. The halo is distracting. Otherwise a nice capture.', '2004-10-04 16:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(941203, 109487, 18197, '<td valign="top">A few weeks ago I took a bunch of seagull-in-flight pictures in San Francisco. I now have a better appreciation of how hard they are to get right. This one is quite interesting because the bird is in a non-typical flight attitude. Well captured. Well focused. The halo around the bird is distracting and lowers my score somewhat. I don''t know if the original resolution would stand up to it but I think if the bird filled more of the frame, it would be better.</td>', 'A few weeks ago I took a bunch of seagull-in-flight pictures in San Francisco. I now have a better appreciation of how hard they are to get right. This one is quite interesting because the bird is in a non-typical flight attitude. Well captured. Well focused. The halo around the bird is distracting and lowers my score somewhat. I don''t know if the original resolution would stand up to it but I think if the bird filled more of the frame, it would be better.', '2004-10-04 16:05:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(941205, 109577, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot but would like it better if there weren''t such a halo around the subject. Maybe it was just like this when the shutter clicked but it feels like a post processing error ... to much dodge and burn. Or maybe too little around the edges.</td>', 'I like this a lot but would like it better if there weren''t such a halo around the subject. Maybe it was just like this when the shutter clicked but it feels like a post processing error ... to much dodge and burn. Or maybe too little around the edges.', '2004-10-04 16:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(941209, 109604, 2764, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Straight out of Wind in the WIllows - I can just see him in his roadster!</td>', 'Wonderful!  Straight out of Wind in the WIllows - I can just see him in his roadster!', '2004-10-04 16:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(941215, 109704, 3087, '<td valign="top">Stunning, very evocative of safari memories since these magnificent creatures really do sleep so much of the time don''t they? Beautifully composed, good light, nice level of detail in cat and branch. Just lovely.</td>', 'Stunning, very evocative of safari memories since these magnificent creatures really do sleep so much of the time don''t they? Beautifully composed, good light, nice level of detail in cat and branch. Just lovely.', '2004-10-04 16:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(941218, 109447, 27524, '<td valign="top">Yes :) not bad working spot. I like these bright colors.</td>', 'Yes :) not bad working spot. I like these bright colors.', '2004-10-04 16:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(941219, 109797, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and wonderful sense of scale provided by inclusion of so much tree. Great use of DOF to leave foreground tree and squirrel in focus and blur background trees - and really like that background is same colour palette as most of foreground rather than green or blue or such. Lovely detail.</td>', 'Lovely composition and wonderful sense of scale provided by inclusion of so much tree. Great use of DOF to leave foreground tree and squirrel in focus and blur background trees - and really like that background is same colour palette as most of foreground rather than green or blue or such. Lovely detail.', '2004-10-04 16:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(941227, 108583, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflections and warm red-golden light.</td>', 'Lovely reflections and warm red-golden light.', '2004-10-04 16:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(941229, 109760, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way that your entry points out that a "natural environment" isn''t necessarily one that excludes humans. Lovely image.</td>', 'I like the way that your entry points out that a "natural environment" isn''t necessarily one that excludes humans. Lovely image.', '2004-10-04 16:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(941230, 108632, 27524, '<td valign="top">Uhhh...i feel like he is going to have dinner ''with'' me... I like the focus through leaves...feels very natural. Still his back could be in picture aswell i think.</td>', 'Uhhh...i feel like he is going to have dinner ''with'' me... I like the focus through leaves...feels very natural. Still his back could be in picture aswell i think.', '2004-10-04 16:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
