(941238, 108189, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a handsome Grey Hornbill - nice pose (lord knows how they don''t get poked to heck by those acacia thorns) and nice catchlight in the eye. Whilst I like the shape provided by some of the branches I think the wider shot results in a loss of impact overall.</td>', 'What a handsome Grey Hornbill - nice pose (lord knows how they don''t get poked to heck by those acacia thorns) and nice catchlight in the eye. Whilst I like the shape provided by some of the branches I think the wider shot results in a loss of impact overall.', '2004-10-04 16:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(941242, 109668, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely feeling of time, place and mood. Lovely muted colour palette. Nice composition.</td>', 'A lovely feeling of time, place and mood. Lovely muted colour palette. Nice composition.', '2004-10-04 16:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(941250, 109615, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning backlight - and yet still a glint in the eye. Did you use flash or was there some ambient light or did you need to dodge a little on the eyes to bring that out? Whichever it is the result is superb. Very intimate portrait of one of my favourite critters.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning backlight - and yet still a glint in the eye. Did you use flash or was there some ambient light or did you need to dodge a little on the eyes to bring that out? Whichever it is the result is superb. Very intimate portrait of one of my favourite critters.', '2004-10-04 16:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(941251, 109533, 27524, '<td valign="top">These colors cant stop amaze me. Red spots of snake and pieces of green and dry grass... and snakes head comming out of dark. What more could wish :).</td>', 'These colors cant stop amaze me. Red spots of snake and pieces of green and dry grass... and snakes head comming out of dark. What more could wish :).', '2004-10-04 16:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
