(941872, 109668, 26526, '<td valign="top">Wonderful mood photograph. I like the tone of it.  Nice cropping. Very catchy title. I really like  by placing the Pelicans and Gulls in the top third of the photo, the fog, mist, is reflected in the smooth water below. Very well done! If I could vote you would get a 10 from me!</td>', 'Wonderful mood photograph. I like the tone of it.  Nice cropping. Very catchy title. I really like  by placing the Pelicans and Gulls in the top third of the photo, the fog, mist, is reflected in the smooth water below. Very well done! If I could vote you would get a 10 from me!', '2004-10-04 21:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
