(942042, 109643, 3417, '<td valign="top">this is great.  i am an artist.  may i have your permission to paint this someday? www.elenassketches.freeservers.com   i think this is the greatest mt lion photo i have ever seen.  i hope you win</td>', 'this is great.  i am an artist.  may i have your permission to paint this someday? www.elenassketches.freeservers.com   i think this is the greatest mt lion photo i have ever seen.  i hope you win', '2004-10-04 22:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(942043, 108890, 22046, '<td valign="top">Small but mighty. The sharp focus gives this picture zing. And the colors of the corn do a great job of offsetting the muted tones of the chipmunk and the background. Excellent image.</td>', 'Small but mighty. The sharp focus gives this picture zing. And the colors of the corn do a great job of offsetting the muted tones of the chipmunk and the background. Excellent image.', '2004-10-04 23:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(942045, 109447, 19608, '<td valign="top">Challenge rules say: non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians.  It is none of those, but a very nice image nonetheless.</td>', 'Challenge rules say: non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians.  It is none of those, but a very nice image nonetheless.', '2004-10-04 23:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(942046, 109643, 22046, '<td valign="top">Love his gaze right at me. Love his soft texture. Love the muted colors. Love the lighting. (Do you get the feeling I like this? You betcha!)</td>', 'Love his gaze right at me. Love his soft texture. Love the muted colors. Love the lighting. (Do you get the feeling I like this? You betcha!)', '2004-10-04 23:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(942047, 109576, 19608, '<td valign="top">Challenge rules say: non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians.  It is none of those, but a very nice image nonetheless.</td>', 'Challenge rules say: non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians.  It is none of those, but a very nice image nonetheless.', '2004-10-04 23:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(942051, 109294, 22046, '<td valign="top">A face that only a mother could love... well, not really. Actually he has a funny face and that makes it endearing. My only complaint is the bright highlights from the flash and the slight out of focus area of his mouth. But other than that - perfect crop. Good color. Funny photograph. 8</td>', 'A face that only a mother could love... well, not really. Actually he has a funny face and that makes it endearing. My only complaint is the bright highlights from the flash and the slight out of focus area of his mouth. But other than that - perfect crop. Good color. Funny photograph. 8', '2004-10-04 23:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(942056, 109295, 22046, '<td valign="top">Yikes! We were in grizzly country this summer. I''m sure glad we didn''t see this! Excellent catch.</td>', 'Yikes! We were in grizzly country this summer. I''m sure glad we didn''t see this! Excellent catch.', '2004-10-04 23:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(942060, 109453, 22046, '<td valign="top">If I kiss him will he turn into a prince? Perfect focus on his eye.</td>', 'If I kiss him will he turn into a prince? Perfect focus on his eye.', '2004-10-04 23:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(942062, 108672, 22046, '<td valign="top">Had to laugh. And bypass the "in the wild" part of the requirments because this is so good. You must have had fun cleaning off your guitar. Yich!</td>', 'Had to laugh. And bypass the "in the wild" part of the requirments because this is so good. You must have had fun cleaning off your guitar. Yich!', '2004-10-04 23:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(942066, 109308, 22046, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of color. Kind of miss his feet but otherwise I like this very much. Great lighting and reflections.</td>', 'Beautiful use of color. Kind of miss his feet but otherwise I like this very much. Great lighting and reflections.', '2004-10-04 23:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(942069, 109615, 22046, '<td valign="top">The backlighting really makes this special. Also love that you can see all the details sharp and clear in the shaded area of the creature. Wonderful. A 10.</td>', 'The backlighting really makes this special. Also love that you can see all the details sharp and clear in the shaded area of the creature. Wonderful. A 10.', '2004-10-04 23:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(942072, 108898, 22046, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how you found this fellow in this setting but it sure is a great place for him to be. Makes an elegant composition. More than just an animal portrait.</td>', 'Don''t know how you found this fellow in this setting but it sure is a great place for him to be. Makes an elegant composition. More than just an animal portrait.', '2004-10-04 23:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(942074, 109641, 22046, '<td valign="top">Super sharp. Excellent capture.</td>', 'Super sharp. Excellent capture.', '2004-10-04 23:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(942078, 109480, 22046, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection, especially his whiskers. Great color too.</td>', 'Love the reflection, especially his whiskers. Great color too.', '2004-10-04 23:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(942083, 108768, 21034, '<td valign="top">What a title. :)</td>', 'What a title. :)', '2004-10-04 23:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(942087, 109795, 21034, '<td valign="top">Are you from Nebraska? Nice catch!</td>', 'Are you from Nebraska? Nice catch!', '2004-10-04 23:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(942089, 109670, 21034, '<td valign="top">Great title and I love the way the light goes right onto his eye!</td>', 'Great title and I love the way the light goes right onto his eye!', '2004-10-04 23:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(942093, 109487, 21034, '<td valign="top">Okay, you dodged the wings, right? But just a touch. Tasteful editing made a world of difference, and I gave this one a 9.</td>', 'Okay, you dodged the wings, right? But just a touch. Tasteful editing made a world of difference, and I gave this one a 9.', '2004-10-04 23:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(942096, 109639, 21034, '<td valign="top">The overall mood here is wonderful, but my eyes need more to lock onto. Maybe more beak? A glimpse of the eyes? I''m not sure. But still good work!</td>', 'The overall mood here is wonderful, but my eyes need more to lock onto. Maybe more beak? A glimpse of the eyes? I''m not sure. But still good work!', '2004-10-04 23:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(942097, 109395, 21034, '<td valign="top">Did you use a polarizing filter? Very interesting composition - it works.</td>', 'Did you use a polarizing filter? Very interesting composition - it works.', '2004-10-04 23:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(942101, 109298, 21034, '<td valign="top">Awesome, awesome color here. But the crop makes me feel like I''m being left out of the action.  Could you have left more in front of his beak?</td>', 'Awesome, awesome color here. But the crop makes me feel like I''m being left out of the action.  Could you have left more in front of his beak?', '2004-10-04 23:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(942104, 109643, 5534, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. You really did great job capturing the texture of the fur and the intensity of the eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. You really did great job capturing the texture of the fur and the intensity of the eyes.', '2004-10-04 23:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(942116, 109577, 26526, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph. Great color. Good stopped motion focus. Excellent cropping and composition. Very well done!</td>', 'Beautiful photograph. Great color. Good stopped motion focus. Excellent cropping and composition. Very well done!', '2004-10-04 23:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(942117, 109663, 26526, '<td valign="top">Striking photograph! I like the color and lilghting. Great composition.</td>', 'Striking photograph! I like the color and lilghting. Great composition.', '2004-10-04 23:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(942122, 109447, 25183, '<td valign="top">Really, a very good picture. I have to side with the argument that insects do not cover wildlife in the world of photography.  5</td>', 'Really, a very good picture. I have to side with the argument that insects do not cover wildlife in the world of photography.  5', '2004-10-04 23:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(942123, 108434, 25183, '<td valign="top">A little too foggy!  You know what you took a picture of because you were there and saw the scene.  The frog is more visible to you then me I think.</td>', 'A little too foggy!  You know what you took a picture of because you were there and saw the scene.  The frog is more visible to you then me I think.', '2004-10-04 23:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(942125, 109475, 25183, '<td valign="top">Gotta love penguins!</td>', 'Gotta love penguins!', '2004-10-04 23:43:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(942133, 109122, 25183, '<td valign="top">I have to go with the idea that insects do not fall into wildlife.  They are not amphibians, reptiles, avians or mammals.</td>', 'I have to go with the idea that insects do not fall into wildlife.  They are not amphibians, reptiles, avians or mammals.', '2004-10-04 23:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(942134, 109654, 26526, '<td valign="top">A really interesting photograph. I like shots like this. Decent focus on the front gull. Something about the background distracts me. Maybe blur it even more? Crop more of it out? A good shot in what can be very diffilcult conditions to photgoraph with strange lighting, and fast flying birds.</td>', 'A really interesting photograph. I like shots like this. Decent focus on the front gull. Something about the background distracts me. Maybe blur it even more? Crop more of it out? A good shot in what can be very diffilcult conditions to photgoraph with strange lighting, and fast flying birds.', '2004-10-04 23:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(942139, 109492, 25183, '<td valign="top">I can''t agree that insects are wildlife...sorry.  Nice colors though!</td>', 'I can''t agree that insects are wildlife...sorry.  Nice colors though!', '2004-10-04 23:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(942142, 109775, 25183, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the animal is a little too dark for its background.  It''s still better than what I got, which was nothing!</td>', 'Perhaps the animal is a little too dark for its background.  It''s still better than what I got, which was nothing!', '2004-10-04 23:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(942152, 109611, 25183, '<td valign="top">A little too close for me.</td>', 'A little too close for me.', '2004-10-04 23:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(942160, 109643, 26526, '<td valign="top">My most favorite photograph in this challenge! It looks like a painting. Such great texture displayed. Love the muted brown colors. Terrific gold lighting.  Fantastic focus, dof.  Excellent cropping. The brooding subject is perfect. I even like the frame. If I could vote I would give you a 10. Hope you make this print available for sale.</td>', 'My most favorite photograph in this challenge! It looks like a painting. Such great texture displayed. Love the muted brown colors. Terrific gold lighting.  Fantastic focus, dof.  Excellent cropping. The brooding subject is perfect. I even like the frame. If I could vote I would give you a 10. Hope you make this print available for sale.', '2004-10-05 00:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(942173, 109308, 26526, '<td valign="top">A terrific photograph! I like the color. Great dof, composition. Superb reflections in it. Fitting title. Hope you do well in the challenge with this one!</td>', 'A terrific photograph! I like the color. Great dof, composition. Superb reflections in it. Fitting title. Hope you do well in the challenge with this one!', '2004-10-05 00:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(942176, 109478, 26526, '<td valign="top">Very well done! I like the color. Good cropping. Great dof.</td>', 'Very well done! I like the color. Good cropping. Great dof.', '2004-10-05 00:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(942207, 109164, 22313, '<td valign="top">This is arguably the cutest shot of the bunch. So I rated it higher than most. Your were able to catch a good, crisp shot. Good Job.</td>', 'This is arguably the cutest shot of the bunch. So I rated it higher than most. Your were able to catch a good, crisp shot. Good Job.', '2004-10-05 00:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(942231, 109788, 26526, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph. Like the color and composition. Maybe a tad deeper dof, but that is being picky. Softer focus works in this photo. I was relieved to see a shot like this in this challenge, not perfect, but has emotional appeal. Looks like this Lion could be in your backyard, not found in a zoo.</td>', 'I really like this photograph. Like the color and composition. Maybe a tad deeper dof, but that is being picky. Softer focus works in this photo. I was relieved to see a shot like this in this challenge, not perfect, but has emotional appeal. Looks like this Lion could be in your backyard, not found in a zoo.', '2004-10-05 00:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(942238, 109787, 26526, '<td valign="top">Great use of color. I like the dof. Excellent cropping. Well done!</td>', 'Great use of color. I like the dof. Excellent cropping. Well done!', '2004-10-05 00:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(942252, 109462, 26526, '<td valign="top">Good photograph. Fantastic in sepia. I love rapture photographs.</td>', 'Good photograph. Fantastic in sepia. I love rapture photographs.', '2004-10-05 00:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(942257, 109671, 26526, '<td valign="top">A really good photograph. Love the colors. Great dof.</td>', 'A really good photograph. Love the colors. Great dof.', '2004-10-05 00:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(942266, 109389, 26526, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color. Like the dof. So well done I would like to see more of this peacock.</td>', 'Beautiful color. Like the dof. So well done I would like to see more of this peacock.', '2004-10-05 00:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(942272, 109660, 26526, '<td valign="top">A fantastic shot. Love the blurred wing movements and color. Great cropping.</td>', 'A fantastic shot. Love the blurred wing movements and color. Great cropping.', '2004-10-05 00:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(942283, 109615, 26526, '<td valign="top">Very, very, good photograph. Like the lighting and color. Great dof. Cute animal.</td>', 'Very, very, good photograph. Like the lighting and color. Great dof. Cute animal.', '2004-10-05 00:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(942291, 109651, 26526, '<td valign="top">Very good photograph. Great focus, dof. Brillient color. Interesting subject.</td>', 'Very good photograph. Great focus, dof. Brillient color. Interesting subject.', '2004-10-05 00:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(942300, 109298, 26526, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph! Bright colors. Like the dof. Great stopped motion. Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful photograph! Bright colors. Like the dof. Great stopped motion. Well done.', '2004-10-05 00:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(942304, 109625, 26526, '<td valign="top">A really good photograph! Like the cool colors. Like the simplicity of this photo. Great composition.</td>', 'A really good photograph! Like the cool colors. Like the simplicity of this photo. Great composition.', '2004-10-05 00:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(942313, 109427, 26526, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Great focus, dof. Good cropping. Like the color contrast. This frog looks like an alien.</td>', 'Very well done. Great focus, dof. Good cropping. Like the color contrast. This frog looks like an alien.', '2004-10-05 00:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(942322, 109484, 26526, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Like the color, red eyelid contrast with the brown and white feathers. Fantastic focus!</td>', 'Very well done. Like the color, red eyelid contrast with the brown and white feathers. Fantastic focus!', '2004-10-05 00:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(942342, 109704, 26526, '<td valign="top">Great photograph. Perfect color, composition. Great dof and focus. Appealing take on lions.</td>', 'Great photograph. Perfect color, composition. Great dof and focus. Appealing take on lions.', '2004-10-05 01:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(942353, 109451, 26526, '<td valign="top">Very good photograph! Great color contrast. I like the dof, focus on the eye. I would have liked to see both eyes, but owl''s aren''t real co-operative. Maybe you took this at a wild bird rehab place, and it had only one eye. Well done!</td>', 'Very good photograph! Great color contrast. I like the dof, focus on the eye. I would have liked to see both eyes, but owl''s aren''t real co-operative. Maybe you took this at a wild bird rehab place, and it had only one eye. Well done!', '2004-10-05 01:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(942354, 109673, 25183, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition...but the wildife???</td>', 'I really like the composition...but the wildife???', '2004-10-05 01:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(942361, 108812, 25183, '<td valign="top">At first, I thought it was a gator behind the duks in the water.  :-)</td>', 'At first, I thought it was a gator behind the duks in the water.  :-)', '2004-10-05 01:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(942374, 109752, 26526, '<td valign="top">This is just the sweetest wildlife photograph I have ever seen!  I can actually see the Mother Giraffe''s lips moving. "When you are older you can cross the river alone." Real Disney like. Love the muted colors, great dof. Nothing distracts from the subjects, and their conversation. Great title!</td>', 'This is just the sweetest wildlife photograph I have ever seen!  I can actually see the Mother Giraffe''s lips moving. "When you are older you can cross the river alone." Real Disney like. Love the muted colors, great dof. Nothing distracts from the subjects, and their conversation. Great title!', '2004-10-05 01:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(942386, 109593, 20539, '<td valign="top">hmmmm. are you sure this is real?<br/>;)</td>', 'hmmmm. are you sure this is real?;)', '2004-10-05 01:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(942402, 109504, 25464, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture on the goose, but the background is too overpowering.  This might be a good candidate for selective desat.</td>', 'Beautiful capture on the goose, but the background is too overpowering.  This might be a good candidate for selective desat.', '2004-10-05 01:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(942403, 109615, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Would have done well in the backlighting challenge I bet.</td>', 'Great shot.  Would have done well in the backlighting challenge I bet.', '2004-10-05 01:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(942433, 109337, 26890, '<td valign="top">This photo is very stunning how the photographer has managed to get the lizard to stay still <br/>Is incredible, or is it stuffed and not a real lizard any way I give it top marks, the focus and color is brilliant      <br/></td>', 'This photo is very stunning how the photographer has managed to get the lizard to stay still Is incredible, or is it stuffed and not a real lizard any way I give it top marks, the focus and color is brilliant      ', '2004-10-05 02:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(942481, 109591, 24664, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors. But maybe it it would nicer if you could see all three tigers?</td>', 'Very nice colors. But maybe it it would nicer if you could see all three tigers?', '2004-10-05 05:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(942482, 109651, 24664, '<td valign="top">This is great..takes a second or two until you see its a croc.</td>', 'This is great..takes a second or two until you see its a croc.', '2004-10-05 05:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(942483, 108672, 24664, '<td valign="top">Funy idea. Who says that wildlife has to be wild?</td>', 'Funy idea. Who says that wildlife has to be wild?', '2004-10-05 05:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(942524, 109447, 2798, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely DOF. 9 - floyd</td>', 'Absolutely lovely DOF. 9 - floyd', '2004-10-05 07:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(942526, 109650, 2798, '<td valign="top">Yow - I dont know what you''ve done around that edge of that bird but it looks VERY post-processed. My guess would be over sharpening or perhaps you took something out of the background. Either way it distracts from an otherwise well laid out picture. 5 - floyd</td>', 'Yow - I dont know what you''ve done around that edge of that bird but it looks VERY post-processed. My guess would be over sharpening or perhaps you took something out of the background. Either way it distracts from an otherwise well laid out picture. 5 - floyd', '2004-10-05 07:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(942527, 109660, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice blur mixed with the flash exposure. Works well but it''s a shame you didn''t have/use second curtain sync. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Nice blur mixed with the flash exposure. Works well but it''s a shame you didn''t have/use second curtain sync. 8 - floyd', '2004-10-05 07:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(942528, 109663, 2798, '<td valign="top">Looks like the colour saturation was pushed up too far on thie one. The rocks look purple and the crane looks blue. Nice composition. 6 - floyd</td>', 'Looks like the colour saturation was pushed up too far on thie one. The rocks look purple and the crane looks blue. Nice composition. 6 - floyd', '2004-10-05 07:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(942529, 108484, 15497, '<td valign="top">Bump up the contrast on this one. Use a lighter background to increase the interest to the subject. but allaruond a good image. good luck</td>', 'Bump up the contrast on this one. Use a lighter background to increase the interest to the subject. but allaruond a good image. good luck', '2004-10-05 07:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(942530, 109670, 2798, '<td valign="top">GREAT composition, colour and DOF. Only thing that could have improved it would have been better light on the swan. 9 - floyd</td>', 'GREAT composition, colour and DOF. Only thing that could have improved it would have been better light on the swan. 9 - floyd', '2004-10-05 07:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(942531, 109748, 15497, '<td valign="top">This rocks! I love how they all look back a ya. Good luck</td>', 'This rocks! I love how they all look back a ya. Good luck', '2004-10-05 07:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(942532, 108439, 15497, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I love the fog? was it produced by blowing air on the lens, or is there this much fog outthere?<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'Nice image, I love the fog? was it produced by blowing air on the lens, or is there this much fog outthere? Good luck', '2004-10-05 07:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(942533, 108583, 15497, '<td valign="top">Excellent, I love the composition and colors 9 Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent, I love the composition and colors 9 Good luck!', '2004-10-05 07:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(942534, 109643, 2798, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colour and light. Well done. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Wonderful colour and light. Well done. 8 - floyd', '2004-10-05 07:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(942535, 109511, 15497, '<td valign="top">well done!</td>', 'well done!', '2004-10-05 07:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
