(942763, 109298, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!  Really clear, perfect for the challenge!!  Nice DOF too :-)</td>', 'Great shot!!  Really clear, perfect for the challenge!!  Nice DOF too :-)', '2004-10-05 11:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
