(942912, 109748, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great shot, funny title. Must be a sight to see them running.</td>', 'Great shot, funny title. Must be a sight to see them running.', '2004-10-05 12:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(942919, 109484, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, wonderful crop</td>', 'Nice shot, wonderful crop', '2004-10-05 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(942920, 109670, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the perspective</td>', 'Great shot. Love the perspective', '2004-10-05 12:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(942928, 109577, 27668, '<td valign="top">Very cool angle on this picture. Awesome detail</td>', 'Very cool angle on this picture. Awesome detail', '2004-10-05 12:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(942930, 109484, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ooooooh. . . . very cool!</td>', 'Ooooooh. . . . very cool!', '2004-10-05 12:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(942931, 109347, 6008, '<td valign="top">Your subject is fairly small and is a little lost in all the clutter of the rest of the image. I understand having the environment in the shot as well to establish location but this image seems a little too much environment and very little animal. If you cant get physically closer or your lens just doesnt reach then cropping the image can also work. Using just the lower third block of the image - cropping down to the intersection of the two diagonals (hollow tree and the branches) and everything else to the right of that would isolate the cub more, still show environment, have a strong diagonal to lead the eye through the shot, be less cluttered, and depending on the size your camera shoots the image you could still get a good 640 crop and have it almost zoomed in to see the detail of the fur and such a cute face.</td>', 'Your subject is fairly small and is a little lost in all the clutter of the rest of the image. I understand having the environment in the shot as well to establish location but this image seems a little too much environment and very little animal. If you cant get physically closer or your lens just doesnt reach then cropping the image can also work. Using just the lower third block of the image - cropping down to the intersection of the two diagonals (hollow tree and the branches) and everything else to the right of that would isolate the cub more, still show environment, have a strong diagonal to lead the eye through the shot, be less cluttered, and depending on the size your camera shoots the image you could still get a good 640 crop and have it almost zoomed in to see the detail of the fur and such a cute face.', '2004-10-05 12:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(942932, 109800, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love it!</td>', 'I love it!', '2004-10-05 12:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(942936, 109361, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awww. . . what an expression.   That is such a compassionate look on his/her face!   It is a little bright -- maybe taken in the middle of the day -- but it makes up for it in emotion and just plain cute!</td>', 'Awww. . . what an expression.   That is such a compassionate look on his/her face!   It is a little bright -- maybe taken in the middle of the day -- but it makes up for it in emotion and just plain cute!', '2004-10-05 13:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(942938, 109671, 24454, '<td valign="top">Those little fellows move QUICK. . . so that was a great catch!</td>', 'Those little fellows move QUICK. . . so that was a great catch!', '2004-10-05 13:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(942941, 109487, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!   That is awesome!  Perfect clarity &amp; focus.   Really, REALLY good job!</td>', 'Wow!   That is awesome!  Perfect clarity & focus.   Really, REALLY good job!', '2004-10-05 13:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(942942, 109587, 6008, '<td valign="top">A very vivid and bright image. Wonderful colors with good detail in the feathers. Considering the entire bird isnt in the shot a tighter crop may have worked better. The background looks nicely blurred but the beak and the shoulder are also a little OOF so just shifting the focus a tad or closing down the aperature a little more would have gotten more of the bird in focus. A very cheerful shot.</td>', 'A very vivid and bright image. Wonderful colors with good detail in the feathers. Considering the entire bird isnt in the shot a tighter crop may have worked better. The background looks nicely blurred but the beak and the shoulder are also a little OOF so just shifting the focus a tad or closing down the aperature a little more would have gotten more of the bird in focus. A very cheerful shot.', '2004-10-05 13:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(942952, 109640, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait!  I could definitely see this matted and framed!    Great focus!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait!  I could definitely see this matted and framed!    Great focus!', '2004-10-05 13:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(942953, 109638, 6999, '<td valign="top">Pretty good work - I like the sense of location especially. Either your post-processing or your camera has let you down somewhat though: those stems of grass have turned into badly fractured lines, and there is a tight white halo-ing around the animal''s neck that seems like over-sharpening. It has the effect of losing detail for you, and thus that sense of closeness so important to shots like this.</td>', 'Pretty good work - I like the sense of location especially. Either your post-processing or your camera has let you down somewhat though: those stems of grass have turned into badly fractured lines, and there is a tight white halo-ing around the animal''s neck that seems like over-sharpening. It has the effect of losing detail for you, and thus that sense of closeness so important to shots like this.', '2004-10-05 13:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(942954, 109341, 24454, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!  I love the intense look on his face -- like he really does NOT want to hear.   Perfect title to go along with the picture.</td>', 'AWESOME!  I love the intense look on his face -- like he really does NOT want to hear.   Perfect title to go along with the picture.', '2004-10-05 13:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(942955, 109734, 6008, '<td valign="top">A very graceful and majestic image. I love the dark color of the water and how it fades back into black. It looks like you''ve blown the details in some of your highlights, but that looks more like a contrast issue than exposure. The orange beak adds a nice splash of color. The stillness of the water and the reflection add to the gracefulness of the image. Very nice.</td>', 'A very graceful and majestic image. I love the dark color of the water and how it fades back into black. It looks like you''ve blown the details in some of your highlights, but that looks more like a contrast issue than exposure. The orange beak adds a nice splash of color. The stillness of the water and the reflection add to the gracefulness of the image. Very nice.', '2004-10-05 13:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(942956, 109213, 6999, '<td valign="top">I can''t see this properly - but I''m in a very bright room. I''ll come back to it. If the definition is as good as I hope it is then it''s a sure winner.</td>', 'I can''t see this properly - but I''m in a very bright room. I''ll come back to it. If the definition is as good as I hope it is then it''s a sure winner.', '2004-10-05 13:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(942958, 109752, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this picture!   The contrast between the giraffe''s and the background make them almost jump out at you!   It is just a tadd too "mid-day bright", but it is a great shot anyway!!!</td>', 'I love this picture!   The contrast between the giraffe''s and the background make them almost jump out at you!   It is just a tadd too "mid-day bright", but it is a great shot anyway!!!', '2004-10-05 13:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(942959, 109793, 6999, '<td valign="top">Some tongue-twister, your title :-) neat shot, though positioning the things head - the natural first point of attention with all animals (and people) - dead centre is in my view weakening the impact considerably. You''ve allowed some location, which is a good thing, but perhaps a little more attention to the overall impact of the composition would have altered the way in which you''ve done that. Gppd sense of detail and texture though.</td>', 'Some tongue-twister, your title :-) neat shot, though positioning the things head - the natural first point of attention with all animals (and people) - dead centre is in my view weakening the impact considerably. You''ve allowed some location, which is a good thing, but perhaps a little more attention to the overall impact of the composition would have altered the way in which you''ve done that. Gppd sense of detail and texture though.', '2004-10-05 13:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(942960, 109507, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is a cool picture!!</td>', 'Wow!  This is a cool picture!!', '2004-10-05 13:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(942962, 109799, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ok. . .is this that "erotic photographer" ??  :) :)   Just kidding.    It''s a very funny capture for a different take on wildlife photography here.</td>', 'Ok. . .is this that "erotic photographer" ??  :) :)   Just kidding.    It''s a very funny capture for a different take on wildlife photography here.', '2004-10-05 13:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(942963, 109295, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oooooooh. . . I sure hope you were in  a zoo for this one.   That would NOT be a face I would like to see close enough to get THIS shot -- even with a mega zoom lense, huh???  Zoo or not, this is a great capture of a very ferrocious wild animal!</td>', 'Oooooooh. . . I sure hope you were in  a zoo for this one.   That would NOT be a face I would like to see close enough to get THIS shot -- even with a mega zoom lense, huh???  Zoo or not, this is a great capture of a very ferrocious wild animal!', '2004-10-05 13:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(942964, 108464, 24454, '<td valign="top">I looked and looked and can''t find the wildlife.    Flowers don''t count.</td>', 'I looked and looked and can''t find the wildlife.    Flowers don''t count.', '2004-10-05 13:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(942967, 109760, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!   Nice shot!  Has a very emotive feel to it.</td>', 'Wow!   Nice shot!  Has a very emotive feel to it.', '2004-10-05 13:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(942969, 109323, 24454, '<td valign="top">She''s beautiful, but I suspect she''s a lot more domesticated than she might look here  :)</td>', 'She''s beautiful, but I suspect she''s a lot more domesticated than she might look here  :)', '2004-10-05 13:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(942976, 109347, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww. . . .very cute.  I wish it wasn''t quite so bright and contrasted.   Maybe taken to middle-of-the-day.  But good capture anyway!</td>', 'Awwww. . . .very cute.  I wish it wasn''t quite so bright and contrasted.   Maybe taken to middle-of-the-day.  But good capture anyway!', '2004-10-05 13:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(942977, 109668, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture!   I really love the misty ocean feel of this picture.   I can just see some inspirational writing at the bottom of this, matted and framed on a wall.</td>', 'Very cool picture!   I really love the misty ocean feel of this picture.   I can just see some inspirational writing at the bottom of this, matted and framed on a wall.', '2004-10-05 13:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(942980, 109395, 24454, '<td valign="top">I totally love this picture!    Good luck.  I hope it does great.</td>', 'I totally love this picture!    Good luck.  I hope it does great.', '2004-10-05 13:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(942982, 109540, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful picture!   The landscape shot is gorgeous, and the wildlife in the picture just adds to it.  Framed picture quality!</td>', 'What a beautiful picture!   The landscape shot is gorgeous, and the wildlife in the picture just adds to it.  Framed picture quality!', '2004-10-05 13:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(942984, 109251, 22046, '<td valign="top">Amazingly sharp and clear. Not looking forward to meeting this guy! Well done.</td>', 'Amazingly sharp and clear. Not looking forward to meeting this guy! Well done.', '2004-10-05 13:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(942986, 109656, 22046, '<td valign="top">What an elegant animal.</td>', 'What an elegant animal.', '2004-10-05 13:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(942987, 109206, 22046, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this was like in color. While I like it this way I miss the yellow of his beak and eyes. I also wonder how he would have looked in a vertical photo. All this said I still think this is a fine image and I rate it a 7.</td>', 'I wonder what this was like in color. While I like it this way I miss the yellow of his beak and eyes. I also wonder how he would have looked in a vertical photo. All this said I still think this is a fine image and I rate it a 7.', '2004-10-05 13:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(942990, 109618, 22046, '<td valign="top">Yeeps! Went to Alaska this summer and fortunately did not see this view of a bear. They are formidable animals. Love his expression. Suggestion - crop tighter on the left. I don''t think the background adds to this. A closer crop makes him even more "in your face."</td>', 'Yeeps! Went to Alaska this summer and fortunately did not see this view of a bear. They are formidable animals. Love his expression. Suggestion - crop tighter on the left. I don''t think the background adds to this. A closer crop makes him even more "in your face."', '2004-10-05 13:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(942997, 109789, 22046, '<td valign="top">Love the bird. Love his look. Don''t love the filter work. For me a tack-sharp photo with none of the post processing would have been much stronger. Still I''m giving this a 7 because of the excellent placement of the bird and the effect of the lighting.</td>', 'Love the bird. Love his look. Don''t love the filter work. For me a tack-sharp photo with none of the post processing would have been much stronger. Still I''m giving this a 7 because of the excellent placement of the bird and the effect of the lighting.', '2004-10-05 13:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(942999, 109751, 22046, '<td valign="top">Great color. Excellent focus right on the lizard. Good one.</td>', 'Great color. Excellent focus right on the lizard. Good one.', '2004-10-05 13:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(943000, 109213, 22046, '<td valign="top">Good grief! Where were these guys? Made me laugh when I saw this. Could be a bit brighter and a bit sharper but those are nits.</td>', 'Good grief! Where were these guys? Made me laugh when I saw this. Could be a bit brighter and a bit sharper but those are nits.', '2004-10-05 13:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
