(943123, 109475, 26526, '<td valign="top">Well done! Nice color, excellent cropping, composition. Dof, other tech things, I can''t address as I don''t know anything about underwater photography. I just like this photograph.</td>', 'Well done! Nice color, excellent cropping, composition. Dof, other tech things, I can''t address as I don''t know anything about underwater photography. I just like this photograph.', '2004-10-05 15:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(943133, 109225, 26526, '<td valign="top">A lovely photograph. I like the color, natuarl setting. Good dof. Excellent cropping.You were lucky to get that close to the fawn.</td>', 'A lovely photograph. I like the color, natuarl setting. Good dof. Excellent cropping.You were lucky to get that close to the fawn.', '2004-10-05 15:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(943138, 109333, 26526, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Good color, excellent cropping. I would like to see a sharper focus used on the deer.</td>', 'Nice shot! Good color, excellent cropping. I would like to see a sharper focus used on the deer.', '2004-10-05 15:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(943156, 109163, 26526, '<td valign="top">Good photograph! I like the focus on the Iguana. The subject gets lost in all that green color, the reason for camouflage. The over exposed area in the right hand bottom corner somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Good photograph! I like the focus on the Iguana. The subject gets lost in all that green color, the reason for camouflage. The over exposed area in the right hand bottom corner somewhat distracting.', '2004-10-05 15:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(943165, 109775, 26526, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I like the dof. The color appears a little off to me. I am sure it was the tricky lighting situation.</td>', 'Nice shot! I like the dof. The color appears a little off to me. I am sure it was the tricky lighting situation.', '2004-10-05 15:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(943169, 109646, 26526, '<td valign="top">A really good photograph. I like the simplicity of it. Excellent color. I like how you cropped it.</td>', 'A really good photograph. I like the simplicity of it. Excellent color. I like how you cropped it.', '2004-10-05 15:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(943171, 109591, 26526, '<td valign="top">Excellent color! Like the dof. Great composition. Well done.</td>', 'Excellent color! Like the dof. Great composition. Well done.', '2004-10-05 15:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(943173, 109540, 26526, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photograph! Everything about it is well done. Like the color, excellent composition. The only thing I might change would be to use a deeper dof.</td>', 'A beautiful photograph! Everything about it is well done. Like the color, excellent composition. The only thing I might change would be to use a deeper dof.', '2004-10-05 15:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(943176, 108632, 26526, '<td valign="top">A really great photograph! I like the color, the dof.  Excellent cropping, composition. This photo pops for me.</td>', 'A really great photograph! I like the color, the dof.  Excellent cropping, composition. This photo pops for me.', '2004-10-05 15:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(943219, 109454, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great abstract idea but I don''t think the colours are rich enough to do it full justice.</td>', 'Great abstract idea but I don''t think the colours are rich enough to do it full justice.', '2004-10-05 16:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(943226, 108974, 17033, '<td valign="top">I like the monotone-like post-processing: creates a nice uniformity across the pic (Perhaps that patch of water should have been coloured similarly)</td>', 'I like the monotone-like post-processing: creates a nice uniformity across the pic (Perhaps that patch of water should have been coloured similarly)', '2004-10-05 16:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(943231, 109756, 17033, '<td valign="top">Now that''s wild!! Lovely fall colours too. Well done</td>', 'Now that''s wild!! Lovely fall colours too. Well done', '2004-10-05 16:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(943236, 109570, 24642, '<td valign="top">A nice shot but lacks post processing to get rid of the grain in the background.</td>', 'A nice shot but lacks post processing to get rid of the grain in the background.', '2004-10-05 16:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(943238, 109587, 17033, '<td valign="top">Fantastic light and clarity on head.</td>', 'Fantastic light and clarity on head.', '2004-10-05 16:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(943245, 109144, 24642, '<td valign="top">Sharp and clear.  The reflection is very good and I like the balance between the nose and the feet.  Cropping is a bit to tight for my taste.</td>', 'Sharp and clear.  The reflection is very good and I like the balance between the nose and the feet.  Cropping is a bit to tight for my taste.', '2004-10-05 16:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(943247, 109143, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great capture of pose and very nice composition. Two constructive criticisms: oversharpened and dull ground taking up too much of pic.</td>', 'Great capture of pose and very nice composition. Two constructive criticisms: oversharpened and dull ground taking up too much of pic.', '2004-10-05 16:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(943251, 109164, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Good harmony in colour between the bird and the bottom of the water.  The lighting could be better and IMO the cropping is to tight.</td>', 'Very cute.  Good harmony in colour between the bird and the bottom of the water.  The lighting could be better and IMO the cropping is to tight.', '2004-10-05 16:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(943259, 109309, 24642, '<td valign="top">A beautiful bird, good colours.  The viewpoint is IMO a bit awkward.</td>', 'A beautiful bird, good colours.  The viewpoint is IMO a bit awkward.', '2004-10-05 16:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(943261, 109752, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good shot and a good title.</td>', 'Good shot and a good title.', '2004-10-05 16:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(943270, 109522, 24642, '<td valign="top">Cool composition, great colors.</td>', 'Cool composition, great colors.', '2004-10-05 16:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(943288, 109533, 24642, '<td valign="top">Cool colours and composition.  The border is a bit on the bolder side for my taste.</td>', 'Cool colours and composition.  The border is a bit on the bolder side for my taste.', '2004-10-05 17:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(943296, 109577, 24642, '<td valign="top">A good shot but seems to be a bit overdone in post processing.</td>', 'A good shot but seems to be a bit overdone in post processing.', '2004-10-05 17:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(943299, 109643, 27605, '<td valign="top">Compelling photo... great side lighting, wonderful warm tones and texture.  The eyes and face are fabulous.  Framing a slight minus, but still magnificent.</td>', 'Compelling photo... great side lighting, wonderful warm tones and texture.  The eyes and face are fabulous.  Framing a slight minus, but still magnificent.', '2004-10-05 17:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(943356, 109704, 24454, '<td valign="top">How CUTE!!!!!   Great shot!   Maybe just a tad too "mid-day bright", but it''s really a great picture anyway.</td>', 'How CUTE!!!!!   Great shot!   Maybe just a tad too "mid-day bright", but it''s really a great picture anyway.', '2004-10-05 18:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(943358, 109478, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love the eyes.   He looks like a very old owl.  Really neat picture.</td>', 'I love the eyes.   He looks like a very old owl.  Really neat picture.', '2004-10-05 18:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(943359, 109447, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ok.   It is really hard for a bug to get a high score from me.  But this has such amazing colors, and the bug is not too ugly looking, so I''m scoring it high.</td>', 'Ok.   It is really hard for a bug to get a high score from me.  But this has such amazing colors, and the bug is not too ugly looking, so I''m scoring it high.', '2004-10-05 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(943361, 109547, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great shot!</td>', 'Wow!  Great shot!', '2004-10-05 18:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(943365, 109447, 25742, '<td valign="top">beautiful. good title also.</td>', 'beautiful. good title also.', '2004-10-05 18:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(943369, 109298, 27524, '<td valign="top">I like the mix of colors in it... like bushes repeat colors of duck. Interesting catch.</td>', 'I like the mix of colors in it... like bushes repeat colors of duck. Interesting catch.', '2004-10-05 18:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(943386, 109341, 25742, '<td valign="top">exactly.</td>', 'exactly.', '2004-10-05 18:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(943389, 109066, 25742, '<td valign="top">BG little bit to hazy for my taste. otherwise very nice. beautiful silhuoette.</td>', 'BG little bit to hazy for my taste. otherwise very nice. beautiful silhuoette.', '2004-10-05 18:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(943390, 109778, 27524, '<td valign="top">Uhhh :) serious moment. Nice quality and contrast.</td>', 'Uhhh :) serious moment. Nice quality and contrast.', '2004-10-05 18:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(943394, 109389, 27524, '<td valign="top">Great colors but could wish bit more sharper focus.</td>', 'Great colors but could wish bit more sharper focus.', '2004-10-05 18:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(943398, 109671, 27524, '<td valign="top">Thats real natural environment. Bit too mich croped on tail :)... would like other angle too cuz of tree on his head but i guess he dont sit still for long.</td>', 'Thats real natural environment. Bit too mich croped on tail :)... would like other angle too cuz of tree on his head but i guess he dont sit still for long.', '2004-10-05 18:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(943402, 109615, 15711, '<td valign="top">The backlighting is superb!  Your focus is so clear and your use of light is excellent.</td>', 'The backlighting is superb!  Your focus is so clear and your use of light is excellent.', '2004-10-05 18:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(943404, 109337, 27524, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best so far :). Just dont understand why pople cut paws off? Good texture of skin and lovely backgrond. Good luck.</td>', 'This is one of the best so far :). Just dont understand why pople cut paws off? Good texture of skin and lovely backgrond. Good luck.', '2004-10-05 18:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(943407, 109800, 27524, '<td valign="top">:)) Looks bit like old lady... Well I take it as pretty interesting shot. Pitty focus is not on these red eyes.</td>', ':)) Looks bit like old lady... Well I take it as pretty interesting shot. Pitty focus is not on these red eyes.', '2004-10-05 18:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(943408, 109507, 15711, '<td valign="top">The vantage point is great and the spectrum of color is wonderful.</td>', 'The vantage point is great and the spectrum of color is wonderful.', '2004-10-05 18:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(943410, 109640, 27524, '<td valign="top">Quality is admirable.</td>', 'Quality is admirable.', '2004-10-05 18:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(943415, 109164, 27524, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture... Poor wet guy :). Not really like the frame. It asks for some more space around it...overcroped.</td>', 'Interesting capture... Poor wet guy :). Not really like the frame. It asks for some more space around it...overcroped.', '2004-10-05 18:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(943417, 109540, 27524, '<td valign="top">Simple good... very nice compozition...cliffs and breaking waves and still bird...</td>', 'Simple good... very nice compozition...cliffs and breaking waves and still bird...', '2004-10-05 18:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(943421, 108559, 27524, '<td valign="top">The flashlight dont work well here. Maybe should leave more space in front as she is looking for jump.</td>', 'The flashlight dont work well here. Maybe should leave more space in front as she is looking for jump.', '2004-10-05 18:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(943423, 109604, 27524, '<td valign="top">:) Didnt know these are climbers. Interesting moment and attracting colors. One of top pictures i suspect.</td>', ':) Didnt know these are climbers. Interesting moment and attracting colors. One of top pictures i suspect.', '2004-10-05 18:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(943425, 109143, 27524, '<td valign="top">Couldnt wish better focus...quality picture.</td>', 'Couldnt wish better focus...quality picture.', '2004-10-05 18:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(943432, 109786, 27524, '<td valign="top">Thats an artist piece :) and humorous too. Wonder about cropping... one of rare times when you cant say it misses something. Colors!!!</td>', 'Thats an artist piece :) and humorous too. Wonder about cropping... one of rare times when you cant say it misses something. Colors!!!', '2004-10-05 18:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(943437, 109308, 27524, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors. Seems other two guys wanted to be in shot aswell :) no way.</td>', 'Stunning colors. Seems other two guys wanted to be in shot aswell :) no way.', '2004-10-05 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(943483, 109674, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice clear image.  Coots are skitish things so good work!</td>', 'Nice clear image.  Coots are skitish things so good work!', '2004-10-05 19:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(943486, 109492, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but the colors are too bright for me... They hide the color of the DF''s ''cheeks''.</td>', 'Nice concept, but the colors are too bright for me... They hide the color of the DF''s ''cheeks''.', '2004-10-05 19:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(943488, 109704, 12792, '<td valign="top">Good image and composition.  Worthy of and simlar can be found in Nat''l Geographic.  The fact that it can be found so readily is why I didn''t rate it higher.  Good work though.</td>', 'Good image and composition.  Worthy of and simlar can be found in Nat''l Geographic.  The fact that it can be found so readily is why I didn''t rate it higher.  Good work though.', '2004-10-05 19:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(943494, 109547, 12792, '<td valign="top">Bison are a great subject!  Togh the composition is good, and the technical details are there, I feel the word, static, when I look at it.  I guess that I''d like to see some motion of somesort here... dust from the ground or somesuch.... Nich idea though!</td>', 'Bison are a great subject!  Togh the composition is good, and the technical details are there, I feel the word, static, when I look at it.  I guess that I''d like to see some motion of somesort here... dust from the ground or somesuch.... Nich idea though!', '2004-10-05 19:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(943499, 109467, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice work in trying to capture the range of light between the shadow and highlights.   I must be honest that the image does not do much for me, though the subject is right on for the topic.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice work in trying to capture the range of light between the shadow and highlights.   I must be honest that the image does not do much for me, though the subject is right on for the topic.  Good luck!', '2004-10-05 19:35:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(943501, 109002, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait... not steriotyped in any way.  The day apears done and boy does he look bushed!  The image tells a good story there.  The technical aspects are all there from light to dark... depth of field and focus on the eyes.   Great work and congrats!</td>', 'Nice portrait... not steriotyped in any way.  The day apears done and boy does he look bushed!  The image tells a good story there.  The technical aspects are all there from light to dark... depth of field and focus on the eyes.   Great work and congrats!', '2004-10-05 19:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(943505, 108898, 12792, '<td valign="top">Everything in balance... except the owl.  No shadow detal at all.  Image is flatish in composition....   I LOVE IT!   THe black off sets the owl, the details in the window frame (black on black) and the details in the stucco too.  Great range of capture and incredible composition.  In a nut shell... simple,  elegent and would make a great 20x30!   Great work... Congrats!</td>', 'Everything in balance... except the owl.  No shadow detal at all.  Image is flatish in composition....   I LOVE IT!   THe black off sets the owl, the details in the window frame (black on black) and the details in the stucco too.  Great range of capture and incredible composition.  In a nut shell... simple,  elegent and would make a great 20x30!   Great work... Congrats!', '2004-10-05 19:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(943506, 109650, 12792, '<td valign="top">Sweet bird...   To be honest,  the composition doesn''t do it for me, though technically I believe it to be "right".  Probabaly just me!  Good luck.</td>', 'Sweet bird...   To be honest,  the composition doesn''t do it for me, though technically I believe it to be "right".  Probabaly just me!  Good luck.', '2004-10-05 19:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(943508, 109623, 12792, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a married couple to me...  Nice composition and overall work.</td>', 'Looks more like a married couple to me...  Nice composition and overall work.', '2004-10-05 19:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(943512, 109424, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice looking animals... The woods in the background are great, and the light and shadows give it great depth.   However, to be honest, the animals seem very flat and without depth or life (telephoto lens?).   There seems to be no spart in them so as a result, I believe the picture as a whole suffers.   Good luck.</td>', 'Nice looking animals... The woods in the background are great, and the light and shadows give it great depth.   However, to be honest, the animals seem very flat and without depth or life (telephoto lens?).   There seems to be no spart in them so as a result, I believe the picture as a whole suffers.   Good luck.', '2004-10-05 19:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(943520, 109662, 12792, '<td valign="top">A bit high on the saturation for my taste.  Some over sharpening, too (one of my challanges!)   The main issue that I have is the lack of highlight and shadow detail.  I know how hard it is to shoot these suckers in direct sunlight, especially at the start and end of the day.  Good luck and keep shooting... They are a worthy subject!</td>', 'A bit high on the saturation for my taste.  Some over sharpening, too (one of my challanges!)   The main issue that I have is the lack of highlight and shadow detail.  I know how hard it is to shoot these suckers in direct sunlight, especially at the start and end of the day.  Good luck and keep shooting... They are a worthy subject!', '2004-10-05 19:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(943524, 109647, 12792, '<td valign="top">Quite nice...   I love the composition, color and the feeling of solid, deep depth...  I would have liked to see some detail in the shoulder and back reigons (burned out), but I also know how hard it is to shoot a white bird against a dark background and not loose something in the translation!<br/>Nice work and good luck!</td>', 'Quite nice...   I love the composition, color and the feeling of solid, deep depth...  I would have liked to see some detail in the shoulder and back reigons (burned out), but I also know how hard it is to shoot a white bird against a dark background and not loose something in the translation!Nice work and good luck!', '2004-10-05 19:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(943526, 109641, 12792, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Not over sharpened (allways a danger with plumage), color balance nice and great depth of field.   Good work and good luck!</td>', 'Very nice!  Not over sharpened (allways a danger with plumage), color balance nice and great depth of field.   Good work and good luck!', '2004-10-05 19:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(943529, 109533, 12792, '<td valign="top">I like it!  The empty shadows give sense of forboding to the image.  Good work!</td>', 'I like it!  The empty shadows give sense of forboding to the image.  Good work!', '2004-10-05 19:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(943532, 109341, 12792, '<td valign="top">Must have heard me singing....   Nice image.  Good depth of field and expression!</td>', 'Must have heard me singing....   Nice image.  Good depth of field and expression!', '2004-10-05 19:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(943534, 109639, 1368, '<td valign="top">Amazing! perfect 10</td>', 'Amazing! perfect 10', '2004-10-05 19:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(943535, 109298, 1368, '<td valign="top">great capture!</td>', 'great capture!', '2004-10-05 19:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(943536, 109387, 19504, '<td valign="top">Would have been perfect if the eagle didn''t look a bit cross-eyed. 8</td>', 'Would have been perfect if the eagle didn''t look a bit cross-eyed. 8', '2004-10-05 19:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(943537, 109778, 19504, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, let me guess what you had for lunch?</td>', 'Hmmmm, let me guess what you had for lunch?', '2004-10-05 19:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(943538, 109163, 12792, '<td valign="top">At first I thought... needs more color contrast (subject v. surroundings).  I then thought... nice image.. show him in his habitate quite well (duhh).  I do have difficulty with the very bright burned out vegitation and back ground.  It make it difficult for me to look at and concentrate on the subject.  Good luck!</td>', 'At first I thought... needs more color contrast (subject v. surroundings).  I then thought... nice image.. show him in his habitate quite well (duhh).  I do have difficulty with the very bright burned out vegitation and back ground.  It make it difficult for me to look at and concentrate on the subject.  Good luck!', '2004-10-05 19:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(943539, 109418, 19504, '<td valign="top">Nice, to bad it''snot completely in focus</td>', 'Nice, to bad it''snot completely in focus', '2004-10-05 19:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(943540, 108439, 12792, '<td valign="top">Tells a story.... Looks like PA!  You dod a good job of capturing the range of light in the photo.  Good luck!</td>', 'Tells a story.... Looks like PA!  You dod a good job of capturing the range of light in the photo.  Good luck!', '2004-10-05 19:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(943542, 109778, 1368, '<td valign="top">mmm smells good :D lol Great picture!</td>', 'mmm smells good :D lol Great picture!', '2004-10-05 19:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(943543, 109797, 1368, '<td valign="top">Awww how sweet is that! Love it :D</td>', 'Awww how sweet is that! Love it :D', '2004-10-05 19:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(943544, 109591, 19504, '<td valign="top">A bit to busy. The tiger on the bottom would have been just fine. He/she has the best expression.</td>', 'A bit to busy. The tiger on the bottom would have been just fine. He/she has the best expression.', '2004-10-05 19:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(943546, 109789, 12792, '<td valign="top">Wow... he looks ticked!   Seriously... Nice thought behind the image, but it seems pixilated... perhaps by sharpening... perhaps intentionally.   For me... that distracts from the image.  Good luck...</td>', 'Wow... he looks ticked!   Seriously... Nice thought behind the image, but it seems pixilated... perhaps by sharpening... perhaps intentionally.   For me... that distracts from the image.  Good luck...', '2004-10-05 19:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(943547, 109164, 19504, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwwww +1 for cuteness factor</td>', 'Awwwwwwww +1 for cuteness factor', '2004-10-05 19:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(943549, 109641, 1368, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful!</td>', 'Simple and beautiful!', '2004-10-05 19:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(943550, 109552, 12792, '<td valign="top">Sweet... You succesfully captured the shades of light trhougout the image.  No easy trick!  I''m not sure why, but I don''t get the feeling of motion here.  The image seems to want to emote it, but I don''t feel it.   Good luck!</td>', 'Sweet... You succesfully captured the shades of light trhougout the image.  No easy trick!  I''m not sure why, but I don''t get the feeling of motion here.  The image seems to want to emote it, but I don''t feel it.   Good luck!', '2004-10-05 19:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(943551, 109591, 1368, '<td valign="top">Amazing!</td>', 'Amazing!', '2004-10-05 19:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(943552, 109643, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most beautiful shots of the challenge.  Excellent focus and clarity.  The eyes are exquisite and the colors are beautiful.  Wonderful shot!</td>', 'This is one of the most beautiful shots of the challenge.  Excellent focus and clarity.  The eyes are exquisite and the colors are beautiful.  Wonderful shot!', '2004-10-05 19:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(943554, 109518, 12792, '<td valign="top">Very nice image..  Worth of Nat''l Geographic, but not steriotyped.   I love the open mouth and the off center framing.  Good work and good luck!</td>', 'Very nice image..  Worth of Nat''l Geographic, but not steriotyped.   I love the open mouth and the off center framing.  Good work and good luck!', '2004-10-05 19:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(943555, 109239, 19504, '<td valign="top">Burp!!! I knew I shouldn''t have had that last piece of cake.</td>', 'Burp!!! I knew I shouldn''t have had that last piece of cake.', '2004-10-05 19:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(943556, 109760, 19504, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I like her in the picture or not, But I do like the shot. 8</td>', 'Not sure if I like her in the picture or not, But I do like the shot. 8', '2004-10-05 19:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(943557, 109143, 14620, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this shot and the colors and clarity are excellent.  Another interesting thing about this photo is the mixture of textures.  I like the smoothness of the water in contrast to all the textures of the bird.  Very Nice job!</td>', 'I love the composition of this shot and the colors and clarity are excellent.  Another interesting thing about this photo is the mixture of textures.  I like the smoothness of the water in contrast to all the textures of the bird.  Very Nice job!', '2004-10-05 19:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(943558, 109610, 12792, '<td valign="top">Waterfowl are hard to capture... they hang out in bright areas with dark plumage... or dark areas with white plumage... I like the composition and the expression... the color of the beak is very nice.  Overall, I have a hard time getting past the blockyness of the head.  Not sure what or why it is that way, but there you have it.  Good luck.</td>', 'Waterfowl are hard to capture... they hang out in bright areas with dark plumage... or dark areas with white plumage... I like the composition and the expression... the color of the beak is very nice.  Overall, I have a hard time getting past the blockyness of the head.  Not sure what or why it is that way, but there you have it.  Good luck.', '2004-10-05 19:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(943560, 109778, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice image... Fun though I suspect in today''s political climate it could end up with a big cencored  sticker over parts of it!  Good work!</td>', 'Nice image... Fun though I suspect in today''s political climate it could end up with a big cencored  sticker over parts of it!  Good work!', '2004-10-05 19:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(943562, 109475, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!! This is a great composition.  I love the capture of the bubbles but what I like most of all is the blue tint to the shot.  It gives it an icy, serene feeling.  Quite beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!! This is a great composition.  I love the capture of the bubbles but what I like most of all is the blue tint to the shot.  It gives it an icy, serene feeling.  Quite beautiful!', '2004-10-05 19:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(943564, 108898, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wow!! What a shot to come across!  Very beautiful, I love the textures of the window sill and the wall and the composition of the shot is wonderful.  Very well done!</td>', 'Wow!! What a shot to come across!  Very beautiful, I love the textures of the window sill and the wall and the composition of the shot is wonderful.  Very well done!', '2004-10-05 20:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(943566, 109452, 12792, '<td valign="top">Love the play of the color.</td>', 'Love the play of the color.', '2004-10-05 20:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(943567, 108559, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice, proffesional shot</td>', 'Nice, proffesional shot', '2004-10-05 20:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(943568, 108189, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, composition and color.  Good work</td>', 'Nice detail, composition and color.  Good work', '2004-10-05 20:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(943570, 109656, 12792, '<td valign="top">Man.... she has some attitude.  Very nice image... great depth, color and emotion.  Great work!</td>', 'Man.... she has some attitude.  Very nice image... great depth, color and emotion.  Great work!', '2004-10-05 20:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(943574, 109309, 12792, '<td valign="top">How the devil did you get so close?  Nice shot!</td>', 'How the devil did you get so close?  Nice shot!', '2004-10-05 20:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(943575, 109751, 12792, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast...</td>', 'Interesting contrast...', '2004-10-05 20:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(943577, 109272, 12792, '<td valign="top">Comon subject... very well done image.  Good depth and very nice color contrasting.  Simple and to the point!  Good work!</td>', 'Comon subject... very well done image.  Good depth and very nice color contrasting.  Simple and to the point!  Good work!', '2004-10-05 20:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(943579, 109795, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice work ..</td>', 'Nice work ..', '2004-10-05 20:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(943580, 109295, 6999, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand this crop for this shot ... that dead background space image left. It''s only effect seems to have been to place the real dynamic elements of the shot dead centre, which simply pull attention away from them toward that dead space - the eye is constantly drawn there, and there is nothing there to add impact. Cropped almost square to the edge of those water drops and you''d have a fabulous image. Your white point seems a touch bright, also - a touch more graduation through the tonal range would have brought out the depth that you have captured I think. Great moment, but let down by your editing I fear.</td>', 'I don''t understand this crop for this shot ... that dead background space image left. It''s only effect seems to have been to place the real dynamic elements of the shot dead centre, which simply pull attention away from them toward that dead space - the eye is constantly drawn there, and there is nothing there to add impact. Cropped almost square to the edge of those water drops and you''d have a fabulous image. Your white point seems a touch bright, also - a touch more graduation through the tonal range would have brought out the depth that you have captured I think. Great moment, but let down by your editing I fear.', '2004-10-05 20:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(943581, 109487, 12792, '<td valign="top">Unusual... I like the motion, the color and the simplicity of your work.  Good luck!</td>', 'Unusual... I like the motion, the color and the simplicity of your work.  Good luck!', '2004-10-05 20:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(943582, 109799, 12792, '<td valign="top">''nough said ...</td>', '''nough said ...', '2004-10-05 20:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(943586, 109744, 12792, '<td valign="top">Duck with attitude... I would have like to see just a tad more in the eye socket area</td>', 'Duck with attitude... I would have like to see just a tad more in the eye socket area', '2004-10-05 20:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(943587, 109649, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail, though the noise in the sky seems out of place against the detailing of the bird itself, and adds an incongruousness that seems unintentional. A good deal of what seems to be thought good in wildlife photography is anthropomorphic - and you have a suitably ''human'' character here - there''s something proud and sneering about the bird - I ust wish you''d sorted out the sky some.</td>', 'Excellent detail, though the noise in the sky seems out of place against the detailing of the bird itself, and adds an incongruousness that seems unintentional. A good deal of what seems to be thought good in wildlife photography is anthropomorphic - and you have a suitably ''human'' character here - there''s something proud and sneering about the bird - I ust wish you''d sorted out the sky some.', '2004-10-05 20:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(943588, 109272, 6008, '<td valign="top">Excellent sharpness and the colors of the fall foliage really compliments the squirrel''s fur well. Only suggestion would be to put the squirrel on the ''third'' and not have it so central in the image.</td>', 'Excellent sharpness and the colors of the fall foliage really compliments the squirrel''s fur well. Only suggestion would be to put the squirrel on the ''third'' and not have it so central in the image.', '2004-10-05 20:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(943589, 109638, 26526, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Like the warm colors, the dof. Excellent composition.</td>', 'Great photo. Like the warm colors, the dof. Excellent composition.', '2004-10-05 20:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(943592, 108439, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - great sense of dpeth, light, fragility of the animal. And that little array of debris from the forest gives the impression that it was caught playing. I would personally have cropped the shot more than this - foreground space seems meaningless to me, and I''d certainly have lost a touch left of frame to privilege the subject some. It has the feeling of an out-of-camera original, rather than a considered presentation. A great original, but it''s very rare that a shot can''t be improved by judicious editing.</td>', 'Beautiful - great sense of dpeth, light, fragility of the animal. And that little array of debris from the forest gives the impression that it was caught playing. I would personally have cropped the shot more than this - foreground space seems meaningless to me, and I''d certainly have lost a touch left of frame to privilege the subject some. It has the feeling of an out-of-camera original, rather than a considered presentation. A great original, but it''s very rare that a shot can''t be improved by judicious editing.', '2004-10-05 20:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(943594, 108439, 26526, '<td valign="top">I like this photo! Curious fawn. Fog. Great dof.  Nice color. You might try cropping off some of the foreground road, and right hand side.</td>', 'I like this photo! Curious fawn. Fog. Great dof.  Nice color. You might try cropping off some of the foreground road, and right hand side.', '2004-10-05 20:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(943595, 109646, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and good composition.</td>', 'Nice shot and good composition.', '2004-10-05 20:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(943597, 109504, 12792, '<td valign="top">I like it!  Motion, ,depth of field...  Good work</td>', 'I like it!  Motion, ,depth of field...  Good work', '2004-10-05 20:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(943598, 108778, 12792, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2004-10-05 20:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
