(943669, 109602, 26526, '<td valign="top">NIce photograph. I like the color even if not much contrast. Good dof and composition. Might try blurring just the background a little more. I find it a little distracting from the cute fellows. Very fitting and humerous title!</td>', 'NIce photograph. I like the color even if not much contrast. Good dof and composition. Might try blurring just the background a little more. I find it a little distracting from the cute fellows. Very fitting and humerous title!', '2004-10-05 20:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(943676, 108890, 11248, '<td valign="top">My preferred one for this challenge. Very beautiful composition and lovely animal. Perfect lighting and sharpness.</td>', 'My preferred one for this challenge. Very beautiful composition and lovely animal. Perfect lighting and sharpness.', '2004-10-05 20:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(943678, 109298, 11248, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Beautiful duck usually easy to take picture on the lake but not so easy in flight. Contrast seems a bit heavy but one of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Great shot. Beautiful duck usually easy to take picture on the lake but not so easy in flight. Contrast seems a bit heavy but one of the best in this challenge.', '2004-10-05 20:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(943681, 108439, 11248, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene. Great catch. One of the best.</td>', 'Lovely scene. Great catch. One of the best.', '2004-10-05 20:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(943682, 109546, 26526, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo in b&amp;w. I like the lighting you used. Might try darkening the background just a little bit more. The lines in it are a little distracting.</td>', 'Very nice photo in b&w. I like the lighting you used. Might try darkening the background just a little bit more. The lines in it are a little distracting.', '2004-10-05 20:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(943684, 109604, 11248, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. Great natural colors. One of the best in this challenge.<br/></td>', 'Wonderful composition. Great natural colors. One of the best in this challenge.', '2004-10-05 20:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(943689, 109663, 19608, '<td valign="top">This image has loads of potential - an excellent scene - very graceful pose of the bird.  But I''m afraid your post processing technique to give the water an orange cast is way too obvious:  a) With the lighting as shown - the bird''s would be more of a sihlouette - not so white.  b) You can see the "real" colors through the brances of the shrubs, around the rocks, and around the bird''s legs.</td>', 'This image has loads of potential - an excellent scene - very graceful pose of the bird.  But I''m afraid your post processing technique to give the water an orange cast is way too obvious:  a) With the lighting as shown - the bird''s would be more of a sihlouette - not so white.  b) You can see the "real" colors through the brances of the shrubs, around the rocks, and around the bird''s legs.', '2004-10-05 20:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(943690, 109547, 11248, '<td valign="top">Wow. That what we can call Wildlife, Surely you get this one with a big zoom lens.</td>', 'Wow. That what we can call Wildlife, Surely you get this one with a big zoom lens.', '2004-10-05 20:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(943692, 109518, 11248, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Smooth colors. Great atmosphere.  Very beautiful beast.</td>', 'Nice catch. Smooth colors. Great atmosphere.  Very beautiful beast.', '2004-10-05 20:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(943695, 108583, 11248, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Would like to see more details of the feathers. Still a nice picture with nocie colors and a very nice reflection.</td>', 'Great picture. Would like to see more details of the feathers. Still a nice picture with nocie colors and a very nice reflection.', '2004-10-05 20:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(943702, 109591, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very relaxed zoo shot.  The pumped up colors pretty much ruin any realism of the image.</td>', 'Very relaxed zoo shot.  The pumped up colors pretty much ruin any realism of the image.', '2004-10-05 20:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(943705, 109789, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great eye - but your post processing did you in.  Way too unrealistic as is.</td>', 'Great eye - but your post processing did you in.  Way too unrealistic as is.', '2004-10-05 20:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(943708, 109662, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent bird but the image has some serious problems. a) Way too contrasty b) halo effect around the bird''s neck c) Beak is too close to the right edge d) Border is very distracting.  The colors are nice and complement the goose nicely.</td>', 'Excellent bird but the image has some serious problems. a) Way too contrasty b) halo effect around the bird''s neck c) Beak is too close to the right edge d) Border is very distracting.  The colors are nice and complement the goose nicely.', '2004-10-05 20:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(943711, 109492, 19608, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a mammal, or reptile, or anything else mentioned in the challenge description.  Nice colorful scene.</td>', 'Not exactly a mammal, or reptile, or anything else mentioned in the challenge description.  Nice colorful scene.', '2004-10-05 20:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(943714, 109387, 26526, '<td valign="top">Great photograph of an American Eagle. Very good composition and dof. I like the blurred background in this shot. I like the focus on the eyes, softer feathers surrounding the head. Just the correct amount of sharpening used.</td>', 'Great photograph of an American Eagle. Very good composition and dof. I like the blurred background in this shot. I like the focus on the eyes, softer feathers surrounding the head. Just the correct amount of sharpening used.', '2004-10-05 20:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(943715, 109122, 19608, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a mammal, or reptile, or anthing else that would meet the rules.</td>', 'Not exactly a mammal, or reptile, or anthing else that would meet the rules.', '2004-10-05 20:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(943728, 109522, 19608, '<td valign="top">Not a bird, not a mammal, not a reptire, not meeting the challenge.  Photographically, the dragonfly is excellent, but the white "stick" draws too much attention.  The dark background is superb</td>', 'Not a bird, not a mammal, not a reptire, not meeting the challenge.  Photographically, the dragonfly is excellent, but the white "stick" draws too much attention.  The dark background is superb', '2004-10-05 21:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(943731, 109639, 19608, '<td valign="top">The idea was superb - it''s very artsy.  But it''s just off the mark a bit.  The "V" shapes from the bird''s body and head are just too crisp-looking.  the back end of the has just  disappeared.  The high key effect is nice.</td>', 'The idea was superb - it''s very artsy.  But it''s just off the mark a bit.  The "V" shapes from the bird''s body and head are just too crisp-looking.  the back end of the has just  disappeared.  The high key effect is nice.', '2004-10-05 21:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(943734, 109673, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - but the connection to wildlife (as defined), if any, is extremely remote.  The left 1/5 of the image contains nothing of tonal value.</td>', 'Nice idea - but the connection to wildlife (as defined), if any, is extremely remote.  The left 1/5 of the image contains nothing of tonal value.', '2004-10-05 21:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(943740, 109604, 19608, '<td valign="top">That pose is fantastic!  I love the brownish tones throughout.  Excellent submission.</td>', 'That pose is fantastic!  I love the brownish tones throughout.  Excellent submission.', '2004-10-05 21:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(943744, 109710, 19608, '<td valign="top">Mammal, reptile, bird?</td>', 'Mammal, reptile, bird?', '2004-10-05 21:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(943753, 109734, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great well saturated colors and a beautiful bird.  The lighting is perfect. My only minor point is that the border detracts.  I would think a thin black border would work better.  Even so - I would place it in the top 10.</td>', 'Great well saturated colors and a beautiful bird.  The lighting is perfect. My only minor point is that the border detracts.  I would think a thin black border would work better.  Even so - I would place it in the top 10.', '2004-10-05 21:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(943755, 108464, 19608, '<td valign="top">Mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment are very hard to pick out.  Too much out of focus.</td>', 'Mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment are very hard to pick out.  Too much out of focus.', '2004-10-05 21:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(943761, 109751, 19608, '<td valign="top">The image is spectacular, but still has its problems.  The blotchiness in the flower petals is very painterly, but very bothersome for a photo.  More careful work during post processing would be appropriate.  Th background color is PERFECT for the green lizzard.  The title seems to imply it''s not in a "natural environment?"  A catchlight in the eye would add some pizzazz. OK - know my comments do sound like I''m very negative about your image - but the good news is that it''s my favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'The image is spectacular, but still has its problems.  The blotchiness in the flower petals is very painterly, but very bothersome for a photo.  More careful work during post processing would be appropriate.  Th background color is PERFECT for the green lizzard.  The title seems to imply it''s not in a "natural environment?"  A catchlight in the eye would add some pizzazz. OK - know my comments do sound like I''m very negative about your image - but the good news is that it''s my favorite of the challenge.', '2004-10-05 21:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(943827, 109760, 4493, '<td valign="top">My highest score given. This shot to me is excellent. By having the human in the shot you''ve taken it from being just an ordinary snapshot, to something artistic. Very moving shot. -danny</td>', 'My highest score given. This shot to me is excellent. By having the human in the shot you''ve taken it from being just an ordinary snapshot, to something artistic. Very moving shot. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(943829, 109251, 4493, '<td valign="top">Although I''m not sure if the background was blurred in PS, the overall shot is strong. Good sharp capture, the eyes are sharp and powerful. One of my top 10 shots. Good work.</td>', 'Although I''m not sure if the background was blurred in PS, the overall shot is strong. Good sharp capture, the eyes are sharp and powerful. One of my top 10 shots. Good work.', '2004-10-05 22:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(943836, 109066, 4493, '<td valign="top">Is he real, is he not?<br/>Doesn''t matter, I like this shot!<br/>The sunset with tree<br/>Gives a feeling of the Serengeti!<br/> <br/>Nice shot, top 10 for me. -danny</td>', 'Is he real, is he not?Doesn''t matter, I like this shot!The sunset with treeGives a feeling of the Serengeti! Nice shot, top 10 for me. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(943842, 109643, 4493, '<td valign="top">Excellent sharp capture. I like the full tonal range within this shot. Nothing is over or underexposed. The fur is detailed and sharp. The catchlight in the eyes and the expression of this cat would strike fear into anyone who might approach. In my top 5 of shots! -danny</td>', 'Excellent sharp capture. I like the full tonal range within this shot. Nothing is over or underexposed. The fur is detailed and sharp. The catchlight in the eyes and the expression of this cat would strike fear into anyone who might approach. In my top 5 of shots! -danny', '2004-10-05 22:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(943847, 109604, 4493, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a wild frog :-)<br/> <br/>I like the composition and detail in the stump he''s on. Posed or not, the expression is priceless. Top 10 shot! -danny</td>', 'Now that''s a wild frog :-) I like the composition and detail in the stump he''s on. Posed or not, the expression is priceless. Top 10 shot! -danny', '2004-10-05 22:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(943852, 109670, 4493, '<td valign="top">A lot of people may have dinged you on the overexposed neck, or underexposed ducks in the background, but to me this shot is more about the relationship between the two types of bird. You have captured a powerful image that proves that exposure isn''t always what makes a good shot. -danny</td>', 'A lot of people may have dinged you on the overexposed neck, or underexposed ducks in the background, but to me this shot is more about the relationship between the two types of bird. You have captured a powerful image that proves that exposure isn''t always what makes a good shot. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(943856, 109593, 4493, '<td valign="top">The streaming rain makes this shot. We don''t see many photos with rain in them, and you have not only captured it nicely, but you have  a nice composition and subject. Well done. -danny</td>', 'The streaming rain makes this shot. We don''t see many photos with rain in them, and you have not only captured it nicely, but you have  a nice composition and subject. Well done. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(943860, 109710, 4493, '<td valign="top">Furry moth... Won''t be seeing these much longer with Fall approaching Winter. Overall good shot, withing my top 20 shots. -danny</td>', 'Furry moth... Won''t be seeing these much longer with Fall approaching Winter. Overall good shot, withing my top 20 shots. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(943864, 109734, 4493, '<td valign="top">Joe Cool is now a swan? :-)<br/> <br/>Classic shot of a swan and its reflection. I''d like to capture a shot like this one day. Nice work. -danny</td>', 'Joe Cool is now a swan? :-) Classic shot of a swan and its reflection. I''d like to capture a shot like this one day. Nice work. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(943868, 109518, 4493, '<td valign="top">Although this may be lacking some contrast, the overall composition and sharpness of this image are real good. Possibly stronger as a portrait instead of landscape crop. Good work. -danny</td>', 'Although this may be lacking some contrast, the overall composition and sharpness of this image are real good. Possibly stronger as a portrait instead of landscape crop. Good work. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(943876, 109298, 4493, '<td valign="top">Sharp shot. Nice colors and working in bright sun no less. Very good exposure. Perhaps crop with less frame behind the duck. Nice work. -danny</td>', 'Sharp shot. Nice colors and working in bright sun no less. Very good exposure. Perhaps crop with less frame behind the duck. Nice work. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(943879, 109577, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not sure, but there may be a bit of dodging on this shot, still I like enough to mark it high. The framing of this bird in the frame with the neck stretched out works real well. Thanks for sharing. -danny</td>', 'Not sure, but there may be a bit of dodging on this shot, still I like enough to mark it high. The framing of this bird in the frame with the neck stretched out works real well. Thanks for sharing. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(943885, 109673, 4493, '<td valign="top">Some may say this isn''t a wildlife shot... where''s the animal... I however think this tells it all. I like the contrast of elements on the two sides of the frame. The paw print right on the edge of the water line works well. Excellent shot. -danny</td>', 'Some may say this isn''t a wildlife shot... where''s the animal... I however think this tells it all. I like the contrast of elements on the two sides of the frame. The paw print right on the edge of the water line works well. Excellent shot. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(943890, 109395, 4493, '<td valign="top">Got a toothbrush? :-)<br/> <br/>Nice shot. I think the extra sky above it doesn''t really strengthen the shot. Perhaps a tighter crop excluding some of the sky. Otherwise, a nice capture of the character of this camel.</td>', 'Got a toothbrush? :-) Nice shot. I think the extra sky above it doesn''t really strengthen the shot. Perhaps a tighter crop excluding some of the sky. Otherwise, a nice capture of the character of this camel.', '2004-10-05 22:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(943892, 109295, 4493, '<td valign="top">If this was in the wild, I sure hope you were in a bus! This is exactly how most people probably imagine what a bear encounter would look like. Good sharp shot, with overall pleasing composition. Good work. -danny</td>', 'If this was in the wild, I sure hope you were in a bus! This is exactly how most people probably imagine what a bear encounter would look like. Good sharp shot, with overall pleasing composition. Good work. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(943895, 108557, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good exposure on this image. Leaving the space on the right of the frame allows for the viewer to wonder where he''s off to, good composition in that regard. -danny</td>', 'Good exposure on this image. Leaving the space on the right of the frame allows for the viewer to wonder where he''s off to, good composition in that regard. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(943898, 109668, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good capture. I''d be interested in seeing some of your other misty morning shots from that morning. Shooting in mist always adds a nice dynamic to photography. May have worked a little stronger in an 8x10 crop, the added space at the bottom doesn''t add to the composition in my opinion. Thanks for sharing. -danny</td>', 'Good capture. I''d be interested in seeing some of your other misty morning shots from that morning. Shooting in mist always adds a nice dynamic to photography. May have worked a little stronger in an 8x10 crop, the added space at the bottom doesn''t add to the composition in my opinion. Thanks for sharing. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(943904, 108898, 4493, '<td valign="top">Who?<br/>Who?<br/>Who?<br/> <br/>I know who! ;-)<br/> <br/>Nice capture of a wild animal in a rural setting. On my screen this image appears to be a little flat. Maybe a slight sharpen and a little more contrast. The black in the window appears dark gray instead of black. I like how the bird is looking right at me as if he''s wondering why I''m looking back at him. Wonderful capture. -danny</td>', 'Who?Who?Who? I know who! ;-) Nice capture of a wild animal in a rural setting. On my screen this image appears to be a little flat. Maybe a slight sharpen and a little more contrast. The black in the window appears dark gray instead of black. I like how the bird is looking right at me as if he''s wondering why I''m looking back at him. Wonderful capture. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(943909, 109337, 4493, '<td valign="top">Lizards are always a good subject for photography. They are very expressive and full of details. You have a nice exposure here. -danny</td>', 'Lizards are always a good subject for photography. They are very expressive and full of details. You have a nice exposure here. -danny', '2004-10-05 22:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
