(945258, 109643, 6349, '<td valign="top">The crop isn''t working for me on this one.  The fur on the bottom right doesn''t add anything to the shot and the paw is cut off.  I think I would like this as a square with only the head, portrait with the full paw, or horizontal with the entire body.  Other than that it is one of my favorites in the challenge.  9</td>', 'The crop isn''t working for me on this one.  The fur on the bottom right doesn''t add anything to the shot and the paw is cut off.  I think I would like this as a square with only the head, portrait with the full paw, or horizontal with the entire body.  Other than that it is one of my favorites in the challenge.  9', '2004-10-06 11:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(945261, 109756, 6349, '<td valign="top">It''s great to see 1. an shot actually taken in the wild and not a zoo, and 2. a shot that shows more background scenery.  I''m not sure how well it will do in the challenge since the wildlife is supposed to be the clear subject and yours is more the entire scene, but I say it''s a great shot.  9</td>', 'It''s great to see 1. an shot actually taken in the wild and not a zoo, and 2. a shot that shows more background scenery.  I''m not sure how well it will do in the challenge since the wildlife is supposed to be the clear subject and yours is more the entire scene, but I say it''s a great shot.  9', '2004-10-06 11:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(945281, 109794, 6349, '<td valign="top">My favorite image in the challenge.  I hope this does well.  It certainly is less "wild" than other shots in the challenge but I admire the fact that it shows an animal in it''s true environment rather than the zoo.  It is the relationship between the rigid urban structures and the vigilant gull that makes this shot what it is.  Of course, the composition and lighitng are excellent.  10</td>', 'My favorite image in the challenge.  I hope this does well.  It certainly is less "wild" than other shots in the challenge but I admire the fact that it shows an animal in it''s true environment rather than the zoo.  It is the relationship between the rigid urban structures and the vigilant gull that makes this shot what it is.  Of course, the composition and lighitng are excellent.  10', '2004-10-06 11:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(945285, 109615, 6349, '<td valign="top">I think this will be getting the blue ribbon soon.  The light and exposure are simply perfect.  Love this shot.  10</td>', 'I think this will be getting the blue ribbon soon.  The light and exposure are simply perfect.  Love this shot.  10', '2004-10-06 11:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(945288, 109323, 6349, '<td valign="top">It will be interesting to see the score on this.  10 from me.  I think it''s great.</td>', 'It will be interesting to see the score on this.  10 from me.  I think it''s great.', '2004-10-06 11:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(945291, 109639, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic.  I award you with a 10 and a favorite for bringing this sort of work to this site.  Thanks.  10</td>', 'This is fantastic.  I award you with a 10 and a favorite for bringing this sort of work to this site.  Thanks.  10', '2004-10-06 11:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(945298, 109668, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wow, didn''t see this one till now.  This is awesome.  Going in my favorites.  10<br/>I really like your crop and choice of leaving the misty empytness in the foreground, it''s a gutsy move on this site and shows you have your own vision.  I would be interested in seeing more photos from this shoot.</td>', 'Wow, didn''t see this one till now.  This is awesome.  Going in my favorites.  10I really like your crop and choice of leaving the misty empytness in the foreground, it''s a gutsy move on this site and shows you have your own vision.  I would be interested in seeing more photos from this shoot.', '2004-10-06 11:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(945302, 109475, 6349, '<td valign="top">I''m happy to come across something as dynamic and beautiful as this.  Good luck in the challenge.  Going in my favorites. 10</td>', 'I''m happy to come across something as dynamic and beautiful as this.  Good luck in the challenge.  Going in my favorites. 10', '2004-10-06 11:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(945307, 109593, 6349, '<td valign="top">This shot is stunning.  The rain, the colors, the composition.  Outstanding work.  Going in my favorites. 10</td>', 'This shot is stunning.  The rain, the colors, the composition.  Outstanding work.  Going in my favorites. 10', '2004-10-06 11:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(945311, 108898, 6349, '<td valign="top">Going in my favorites.  Nice to see some wise use of simplicity in this challenge.  10</td>', 'Going in my favorites.  Nice to see some wise use of simplicity in this challenge.  10', '2004-10-06 11:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(945348, 109618, 27524, '<td valign="top">Uh angry... you catched good emotion... Nice details...his nose and mouth.</td>', 'Uh angry... you catched good emotion... Nice details...his nose and mouth.', '2004-10-06 11:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(945354, 108189, 27524, '<td valign="top">It have interesting details but in whole peace they get lost... maybe more zoom on that bird.</td>', 'It have interesting details but in whole peace they get lost... maybe more zoom on that bird.', '2004-10-06 11:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(945358, 109760, 27524, '<td valign="top">Good...moody...but the front ground attracts more attention then birds themself.</td>', 'Good...moody...but the front ground attracts more attention then birds themself.', '2004-10-06 11:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(945365, 109163, 27524, '<td valign="top">She lives in messy place :). Well i would crop out all these leaves and branches and leave just iguana...would feel more tastful.</td>', 'She lives in messy place :). Well i would crop out all these leaves and branches and leave just iguana...would feel more tastful.', '2004-10-06 12:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(945375, 109793, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good coloring, I like the various tones of yellow/brown in the shot. Lighting is nice and even. Texture in the fur is great, it looks very velvety. Composition is good too. Very sharp and clear image.</td>', 'Good coloring, I like the various tones of yellow/brown in the shot. Lighting is nice and even. Texture in the fur is great, it looks very velvety. Composition is good too. Very sharp and clear image.', '2004-10-06 12:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(945378, 109143, 6008, '<td valign="top">Cute guy and he''s in a great pose. Composition is good too. Colors are good with a splash of color in the otherwise muted tones. Only nitpick is that it looks a little oversharpened as the white halo around the head really stands out against the blue of the water.</td>', 'Cute guy and he''s in a great pose. Composition is good too. Colors are good with a splash of color in the otherwise muted tones. Only nitpick is that it looks a little oversharpened as the white halo around the head really stands out against the blue of the water.', '2004-10-06 12:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(945386, 109660, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. You''ve got the artistic look of exaggerated motion blur and it works well, especially as the eye is nice and sharp with the catchlight. The blues and yellows in the image are also very complimentary colors and helps with the flow of the image. Not everyone''s cup of tea, but I like it.</td>', 'Interesting shot. You''ve got the artistic look of exaggerated motion blur and it works well, especially as the eye is nice and sharp with the catchlight. The blues and yellows in the image are also very complimentary colors and helps with the flow of the image. Not everyone''s cup of tea, but I like it.', '2004-10-06 12:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(945391, 109195, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal of the wood and the position of the lizard on the diagonal helps with the flow of the eye through the image. I like the color combo of the light and the green also. I''m a fan of shallow dof but I feel there is just a little too much OOF in the shot overall.</td>', 'I like the diagonal of the wood and the position of the lizard on the diagonal helps with the flow of the eye through the image. I like the color combo of the light and the green also. I''m a fan of shallow dof but I feel there is just a little too much OOF in the shot overall.', '2004-10-06 12:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(945408, 109251, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good close up and nicely sharp. A difficult subject to expose correctly. Looks like you blew out the details in the highlights a little on the right plume and up along the edge of the head. In comparison the eye is a little dark, and as with human portraits a catchlight in the eye can really make the difference too. You''ve also isolated him from the background well.</td>', 'Good close up and nicely sharp. A difficult subject to expose correctly. Looks like you blew out the details in the highlights a little on the right plume and up along the edge of the head. In comparison the eye is a little dark, and as with human portraits a catchlight in the eye can really make the difference too. You''ve also isolated him from the background well.', '2004-10-06 12:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(945428, 109748, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah, humor.  Nice composition and exposure.  Cold use a bit more DoF if that would be possible although the oof grass in th foreground is certainly not a showstopper by any means.</td>', 'Ah, humor.  Nice composition and exposure.  Cold use a bit more DoF if that would be possible although the oof grass in th foreground is certainly not a showstopper by any means.', '2004-10-06 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(945431, 109002, 19608, '<td valign="top">The backlighting makes this image.  It is just right - not blown away and still allows great exposure on the face.</td>', 'The backlighting makes this image.  It is just right - not blown away and still allows great exposure on the face.', '2004-10-06 12:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(945436, 109752, 13381, '<td valign="top">I think this is an awesome picture. I love the detail of the skin and the fur, and the framing and the juxtaposition of the tall giraffe and the shorter giraffe...  You''re one of my picks for the top three.  I hope you do very well in this competition. :)</td>', 'I think this is an awesome picture. I love the detail of the skin and the fur, and the framing and the juxtaposition of the tall giraffe and the shorter giraffe...  You''re one of my picks for the top three.  I hope you do very well in this competition. :)', '2004-10-06 12:28:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(945439, 109547, 6008, '<td valign="top">They look like two mighty mountains clashing together. In an idea world the bush in the foreground wouldnt be there, but when something happens on the spur of the moment you cant exactly control the environment. I like the deep gradient green in the background over the backs of the bison, it compliments the brown of their coat very well.  The lighting and textures are good also. Only thing that stands out as being a little unusual are the eyes. The faces are very dark, almost to the point of being in total shadow although I can see some detail, but the eyes are very bright and the whites almost a little too white, if that makes sense. An interesting shot, very clash of the titans.</td>', 'They look like two mighty mountains clashing together. In an idea world the bush in the foreground wouldnt be there, but when something happens on the spur of the moment you cant exactly control the environment. I like the deep gradient green in the background over the backs of the bison, it compliments the brown of their coat very well.  The lighting and textures are good also. Only thing that stands out as being a little unusual are the eyes. The faces are very dark, almost to the point of being in total shadow although I can see some detail, but the eyes are very bright and the whites almost a little too white, if that makes sense. An interesting shot, very clash of the titans.', '2004-10-06 12:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(945443, 109775, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice play with sunlight... though too much empty space around i think.</td>', 'Nice play with sunlight... though too much empty space around i think.', '2004-10-06 12:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(945444, 108898, 19608, '<td valign="top">You''ve proven it again, the most simple images are often the most effective.  Great composition and exposure.  The only small thing, out of your control, is the white streaks on the window sill.  Great job destined for to be in the top 10 in my opinion.</td>', 'You''ve proven it again, the most simple images are often the most effective.  Great composition and exposure.  The only small thing, out of your control, is the white streaks on the window sill.  Great job destined for to be in the top 10 in my opinion.', '2004-10-06 12:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(945447, 109478, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good muted coloring. The image seems a little soft but I can still see the texture in some of the feathers. Owls are known for their big eyes and it is one of their definiing features. In this shot the eyes are very dark and receded and you cant really see them. As this was an advanced challenge, cloning out the two branches on the right may have helped a little too as they seem to be growing out of the owl''s back.</td>', 'Good muted coloring. The image seems a little soft but I can still see the texture in some of the feathers. Owls are known for their big eyes and it is one of their definiing features. In this shot the eyes are very dark and receded and you cant really see them. As this was an advanced challenge, cloning out the two branches on the right may have helped a little too as they seem to be growing out of the owl''s back.', '2004-10-06 12:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(945448, 109294, 27524, '<td valign="top">Colors are impressive... bit sad or dreamy green guy...</td>', 'Colors are impressive... bit sad or dreamy green guy...', '2004-10-06 12:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(945451, 108974, 6008, '<td valign="top">Hrm, the colors may be correct, but the image looks like it has a bluish cast. It also lacks contrast. It tells a story of urban wildlife, though, and you''ve managed to catch it as it grabs a drink in the puddle, which gives it interest and makes it slightly different from the norm.</td>', 'Hrm, the colors may be correct, but the image looks like it has a bluish cast. It also lacks contrast. It tells a story of urban wildlife, though, and you''ve managed to catch it as it grabs a drink in the puddle, which gives it interest and makes it slightly different from the norm.', '2004-10-06 12:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(945465, 109577, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice in-flight capture.  I like the colors and the fact that there is still motion in the wingtips.  The halo / glow around the body seems a bit artifical - buy I guess the sun could just possibly be behind him (but I really don''t think so.)</td>', 'Nice in-flight capture.  I like the colors and the fact that there is still motion in the wingtips.  The halo / glow around the body seems a bit artifical - buy I guess the sun could just possibly be behind him (but I really don''t think so.)', '2004-10-06 12:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(945466, 109591, 13381, '<td valign="top">Truthfully, I fall into the "if you shot it at a zoo, it doesn''t -really- qualify as wildlife photography" camp, but on the other hand, I''m a sucker for a great photo, and I think this is a great photo.  It looks as though you''ve boosted color saturation a biit, but It hink it works well -- the tigers pop out from the screen in a really cool and appealing way.  Good job.</td>', 'Truthfully, I fall into the "if you shot it at a zoo, it doesn''t -really- qualify as wildlife photography" camp, but on the other hand, I''m a sucker for a great photo, and I think this is a great photo.  It looks as though you''ve boosted color saturation a biit, but It hink it works well -- the tigers pop out from the screen in a really cool and appealing way.  Good job.', '2004-10-06 12:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(945468, 108583, 6008, '<td valign="top">Looks almost like a painting! The warm colors are very inviting, has a very autumn/fall feel to it. The soft focus also adds a somewhat dreamy feel to the image also. The reflection adds a somewhat symmetrical feel to the shot, and the composition is wonderful. Only nitpick is the exposure, which is really difficult with these birds, as it looks like you''ve blown the highlights on the top of the body.</td>', 'Looks almost like a painting! The warm colors are very inviting, has a very autumn/fall feel to it. The soft focus also adds a somewhat dreamy feel to the image also. The reflection adds a somewhat symmetrical feel to the shot, and the composition is wonderful. Only nitpick is the exposure, which is really difficult with these birds, as it looks like you''ve blown the highlights on the top of the body.', '2004-10-06 12:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(945513, 109788, 10414, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice, clear shot. He sure looks like he rules the roost, huh? :)</td>', 'This is a very nice, clear shot. He sure looks like he rules the roost, huh? :)', '2004-10-06 13:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(945558, 109518, 21714, '<td valign="top">This is my top pick. Love those tones and how the control of DOF. 10 &amp; Best of luck</td>', 'This is my top pick. Love those tones and how the control of DOF. 10 & Best of luck', '2004-10-06 13:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(945701, 109593, 15891, '<td valign="top">Ick! Eeww! Gross! This photo makes me want to grab my blanket and hide in the safetly of my living room! But regardless of my distaste of the content, it is a very well done image and you obviously had to endure some discomfort to capture it. Very good work - 10</td>', 'Ick! Eeww! Gross! This photo makes me want to grab my blanket and hide in the safetly of my living room! But regardless of my distaste of the content, it is a very well done image and you obviously had to endure some discomfort to capture it. Very good work - 10', '2004-10-06 14:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(945704, 109643, 15891, '<td valign="top">Sharp, beautifully lit, and your subject is one of my faves!</td>', 'Sharp, beautifully lit, and your subject is one of my faves!', '2004-10-06 14:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(945767, 109668, 8139, '<td valign="top">A surrealistic dream. Beautiful.</td>', 'A surrealistic dream. Beautiful.', '2004-10-06 14:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(945777, 108898, 8139, '<td valign="top">I like this composition.</td>', 'I like this composition.', '2004-10-06 14:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(945782, 109484, 8139, '<td valign="top">The best of the owls? (hehe, I submitted one myself, but yours is outstanding)</td>', 'The best of the owls? (hehe, I submitted one myself, but yours is outstanding)', '2004-10-06 14:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(945789, 109643, 8139, '<td valign="top">Lighting, tones, expression...A top 10?</td>', 'Lighting, tones, expression...A top 10?', '2004-10-06 14:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(945795, 109615, 8139, '<td valign="top">great backlighting !</td>', 'great backlighting !', '2004-10-06 14:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(945818, 109639, 8139, '<td valign="top">Good to try abstracts. It''s a bit too "pastel" and light for my taste. It lacks perhaps a strong line or center of interest? Keep trying this way nevertheless</td>', 'Good to try abstracts. It''s a bit too "pastel" and light for my taste. It lacks perhaps a strong line or center of interest? Keep trying this way nevertheless', '2004-10-06 14:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(945846, 109604, 25388, '<td valign="top">great composition, great texture, very creative and technically spot on; my favorite in this challenge; bump to 10; congratulations.</td>', 'great composition, great texture, very creative and technically spot on; my favorite in this challenge; bump to 10; congratulations.', '2004-10-06 14:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(946241, 108672, 10047, '<td valign="top">Unique and creative. Maybe the snail is to centered, but I like the photo.</td>', 'Unique and creative. Maybe the snail is to centered, but I like the photo.', '2004-10-06 16:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(946245, 109272, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent. I might have tried darkening a little bit, or more contrast, but its still excellent.</td>', 'Excellent. I might have tried darkening a little bit, or more contrast, but its still excellent.', '2004-10-06 16:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(946249, 109787, 10047, '<td valign="top">Clean, crisp, and clear. Maybe cropped to tight, but I don''t know what you had to work with.</td>', 'Clean, crisp, and clear. Maybe cropped to tight, but I don''t know what you had to work with.', '2004-10-06 16:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(946254, 108557, 10047, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like he wanted company. Excellent shot with good focus and clarity. Not sure I would have cropped the foreground so much, but I don''t know what you had to work with.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like he wanted company. Excellent shot with good focus and clarity. Not sure I would have cropped the foreground so much, but I don''t know what you had to work with.', '2004-10-06 16:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(946257, 108778, 10047, '<td valign="top">WOW! Talk about close and clear. Excellent. I might have tried changing the color of the sky, but thats just personal taste.</td>', 'WOW! Talk about close and clear. Excellent. I might have tried changing the color of the sky, but thats just personal taste.', '2004-10-06 16:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(946261, 109646, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Seems a little flat. I might have tried sharpening and contrast to try and make it POP a little more.</td>', 'Nice capture. Seems a little flat. I might have tried sharpening and contrast to try and make it POP a little more.', '2004-10-06 16:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(946264, 109748, 10047, '<td valign="top">Funny. Those are some serious booties! I might have tried cropping out the antelope on the left to see what happened to the composition.</td>', 'Funny. Those are some serious booties! I might have tried cropping out the antelope on the left to see what happened to the composition.', '2004-10-06 16:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(946270, 109744, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Crisp and clean. I might have tried some dodging around the eye, but the photo was executed very well.</td>', 'Excellent. Crisp and clean. I might have tried some dodging around the eye, but the photo was executed very well.', '2004-10-06 16:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(946276, 109387, 10047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I might have tried darkening a little or more contrast, but still very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful. I might have tried darkening a little or more contrast, but still very nice.', '2004-10-06 17:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(946287, 109756, 10047, '<td valign="top">WOW! What an opportunity. Excellent composition. I might have experimented with the contrast a little.</td>', 'WOW! What an opportunity. Excellent composition. I might have experimented with the contrast a little.', '2004-10-06 17:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(946297, 109745, 10047, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little soft and overexposed. I''ve been trying to get a close up of these guys for sometime, but to no avail.</td>', 'Maybe a little soft and overexposed. I''ve been trying to get a close up of these guys for sometime, but to no avail.', '2004-10-06 17:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(946312, 109307, 10047, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little soft. I would have tried cropping so there was more space in front of the gator instead of behind.</td>', 'Maybe a little soft. I would have tried cropping so there was more space in front of the gator instead of behind.', '2004-10-06 17:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(946315, 109800, 10047, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more DOF.</td>', 'Needs a little more DOF.', '2004-10-06 17:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(946317, 108574, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I was just in the Rockies and saw a moose.   I waited and waited and waited forEVER for him to stand up -- to no avail.   I know how shy these animals are, and how hard it is to capture them in pictures.   This is amazing!</td>', 'Wow!  I was just in the Rockies and saw a moose.   I waited and waited and waited forEVER for him to stand up -- to no avail.   I know how shy these animals are, and how hard it is to capture them in pictures.   This is amazing!', '2004-10-06 17:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(946321, 108768, 10047, '<td valign="top">Yeah, mallards are like that. Seems a little over exposed. I ight have tried darkening or more contrast.</td>', 'Yeah, mallards are like that. Seems a little over exposed. I ight have tried darkening or more contrast.', '2004-10-06 17:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(946326, 109663, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Seems like the foreground is competing for the attention of the bird. I might have tried some different crops.</td>', 'Nice colors. Seems like the foreground is competing for the attention of the bird. I might have tried some different crops.', '2004-10-06 17:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(946330, 109492, 10047, '<td valign="top">Seems like it need a deeper DOF. The colors and lighting give the photo a nice feel.</td>', 'Seems like it need a deeper DOF. The colors and lighting give the photo a nice feel.', '2004-10-06 17:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(946340, 109467, 10047, '<td valign="top">Background seems a little washed out and the fence and pipe are distracting. Then again, it doesn''t look like a snake I''d want to relocate to better photographic location.</td>', 'Background seems a little washed out and the fence and pipe are distracting. Then again, it doesn''t look like a snake I''d want to relocate to better photographic location.', '2004-10-06 17:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(946344, 109775, 10047, '<td valign="top">Maybe to centered in the frame. To bad he was just on the edge of the lighting.</td>', 'Maybe to centered in the frame. To bad he was just on the edge of the lighting.', '2004-10-06 17:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(946351, 109650, 10047, '<td valign="top">I think you needed a little faster shutter speed, or maybe the AF grabbed the feeder instead of the bird.</td>', 'I think you needed a little faster shutter speed, or maybe the AF grabbed the feeder instead of the bird.', '2004-10-06 17:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(946358, 108439, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice feel. Not sure if the softness is from the mist or the focus. Nice compsition.</td>', 'Nice feel. Not sure if the softness is from the mist or the focus. Nice compsition.', '2004-10-06 17:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(946370, 109462, 10047, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Red Tail Hawk. Hope you''ll post the color version afterwards. I''d probably play around with the cropping also, and try to give more room on the right.</td>', 'Looks like a Red Tail Hawk. Hope you''ll post the color version afterwards. I''d probably play around with the cropping also, and try to give more room on the right.', '2004-10-06 17:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(946384, 109424, 10047, '<td valign="top">Seems a little soft. I might have tried cropping so the deer were more on the right, but I don''t know what you had to work with.</td>', 'Seems a little soft. I might have tried cropping so the deer were more on the right, but I don''t know what you had to work with.', '2004-10-06 17:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(946388, 109373, 10047, '<td valign="top">Seems a little washed out, and I might have cropped more off the right side.</td>', 'Seems a little washed out, and I might have cropped more off the right side.', '2004-10-06 17:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(946395, 109386, 10047, '<td valign="top">Seems a little soft. I like the placement and composition.</td>', 'Seems a little soft. I like the placement and composition.', '2004-10-06 17:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
