(946946, 108439, 12253, '<td valign="top">The light is great--has a very surreal painterly feel as well as the surrealness of this fawn out of his environment.  This is my top pick for the challenge; I hope you do well and don''t get hit for the "unnatural" environment.  That''s the fault of people, and it gives this more impact.</td>', 'The light is great--has a very surreal painterly feel as well as the surrealness of this fawn out of his environment.  This is my top pick for the challenge; I hope you do well and don''t get hit for the "unnatural" environment.  That''s the fault of people, and it gives this more impact.', '2004-10-06 22:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
