(947208, 108434, 23394, '<td valign="top">well, at least there is a living animal in the image.  however, the image quality is extremely poor.  i don''t know what the shooting conditions were, but you would probably score higher without the foggy, blurry appearance.</td>', 'well, at least there is a living animal in the image.  however, the image quality is extremely poor.  i don''t know what the shooting conditions were, but you would probably score higher without the foggy, blurry appearance.', '2004-10-07 00:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
