(947292, 109618, 23394, '<td valign="top">not a happy camper, is he?  great capture!  good job with the composition.  i''m sure it would have been very easy to shoot this dead on.  wonderful expression.  hope this does well for you.</td>', 'not a happy camper, is he?  great capture!  good job with the composition.  i''m sure it would have been very easy to shoot this dead on.  wonderful expression.  hope this does well for you.', '2004-10-07 01:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
