(947733, 109793, 20364, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Great composition which is difficult to pull off in a challenge like this.  I respect those that are able to pull this off.  It was very important in my voting that the photos fit the challenge and that the wildlife at least seemed to be in a natural environment.  This certainly meets those requirements.  A 9.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Great composition which is difficult to pull off in a challenge like this.  I respect those that are able to pull this off.  It was very important in my voting that the photos fit the challenge and that the wildlife at least seemed to be in a natural environment.  This certainly meets those requirements.  A 9.', '2004-10-07 07:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
