(948522, 109705, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried a smaller crop with less height. Maybe cut it off on the just on the far side of the stream.</td>', 'I might have tried a smaller crop with less height. Maybe cut it off on the just on the far side of the stream.', '2004-10-07 16:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
