(949397, 109639, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like the way this turned out.  I''ll be interested to see how other DPCers view it.  To me, it''s kind of an abstract pastel with a nice viewing quality.</td>', 'I like the way this turned out.  I''ll be interested to see how other DPCers view it.  To me, it''s kind of an abstract pastel with a nice viewing quality.', '2004-10-07 23:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
