(949417, 109451, 18505, '<td valign="top">I love the expression.  A beautiful picture. The branch is slightly distracting and the picture might be even more impactful without it; however, it did not affect the high score I gave you.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the expression.  A beautiful picture. The branch is slightly distracting and the picture might be even more impactful without it; however, it did not affect the high score I gave you.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-07 23:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(949428, 108632, 18505, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture!  Love the expression, the lighting, and the composition.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Excellent capture!  Love the expression, the lighting, and the composition.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-10-08 00:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(949432, 109618, 18505, '<td valign="top">Scary expression!!!  Clearly demonstrates why we stay away from bears!  Good luck in the challenge!  Great capture!!</td>', 'Scary expression!!!  Clearly demonstrates why we stay away from bears!  Good luck in the challenge!  Great capture!!', '2004-10-08 00:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(949440, 109487, 18505, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful capture!!  I like this a lot.  It''s so unusual, and almost looks like the bird is saying "what are YOU doing up here?</td>', 'What a wonderful capture!!  I like this a lot.  It''s so unusual, and almost looks like the bird is saying "what are YOU doing up here?', '2004-10-08 00:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(949446, 109436, 18505, '<td valign="top">I love this!!  Great expression, and great capture.  It''s an unusual crop, but I think it works very well for this image.  Good luck in the challenge!!</td>', 'I love this!!  Great expression, and great capture.  It''s an unusual crop, but I think it works very well for this image.  Good luck in the challenge!!', '2004-10-08 00:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(949453, 108890, 18505, '<td valign="top">These little guys are great!!!  The corn is a wonderful  balance point.  Perfect depth of field and focus.  I''m looking forward to seeing what kind of camera and lens you use.  Good luck in the challenge!!!  I hope you do very well!</td>', 'These little guys are great!!!  The corn is a wonderful  balance point.  Perfect depth of field and focus.  I''m looking forward to seeing what kind of camera and lens you use.  Good luck in the challenge!!!  I hope you do very well!', '2004-10-08 00:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(949472, 108898, 18505, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  I almost expect Harry Potter to appear in the background.  I keep coming back to this picture.  It''s great!!  Good luck in the challenge!!</td>', 'I love this image.  I almost expect Harry Potter to appear in the background.  I keep coming back to this picture.  It''s great!!  Good luck in the challenge!!', '2004-10-08 00:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(949494, 109295, 18505, '<td valign="top">This is a scary image.  The bear is obviously not happy about getting his picture taken.  Great capture. The expression is priceless.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a scary image.  The bear is obviously not happy about getting his picture taken.  Great capture. The expression is priceless.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-08 00:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(949500, 109294, 18505, '<td valign="top">I love the expression and the colors in the image.</td>', 'I love the expression and the colors in the image.', '2004-10-08 00:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(949509, 109793, 18505, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  Not an easy shot to get...  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent capture.  Not an easy shot to get...  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-08 00:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(949583, 109643, 18505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors... Great expression!!  It''s hypnotic.  I love the overall tawnyness of the picture.  These cats are pretty thick around this area although we rarely see them.  A couple of years ago, one ventured into the Holy Cross Abbey during morning prayers.  A woman was kneeling at prayer, when the mountain lion just walked up the aisle and lay down in front of the alter.  I imagine that the woman''s prayers changed just about then!!  She got out o.k., and the DOW tranquilized the lion and moved him to a less populated area.  <br/> <br/>Beautiful capture.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful colors... Great expression!!  It''s hypnotic.  I love the overall tawnyness of the picture.  These cats are pretty thick around this area although we rarely see them.  A couple of years ago, one ventured into the Holy Cross Abbey during morning prayers.  A woman was kneeling at prayer, when the mountain lion just walked up the aisle and lay down in front of the alter.  I imagine that the woman''s prayers changed just about then!!  She got out o.k., and the DOW tranquilized the lion and moved him to a less populated area.   Beautiful capture.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-08 00:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(949591, 109395, 18505, '<td valign="top">Very funny image!!  Good luck in the challenge!!</td>', 'Very funny image!!  Good luck in the challenge!!', '2004-10-08 00:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(949595, 109480, 18505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-10-08 00:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(949599, 109641, 18505, '<td valign="top">What an interesting picture!  Very unusual capture.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What an interesting picture!  Very unusual capture.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-08 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(949603, 109704, 18505, '<td valign="top">OMG, how beautiful!!  Makes you want to just reach out and scratch her chin.  Best of luck in the challenge.  Great image!!</td>', 'OMG, how beautiful!!  Makes you want to just reach out and scratch her chin.  Best of luck in the challenge.  Great image!!', '2004-10-08 00:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(949608, 109369, 18505, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the colors.  They look so relaxed!!  Excellent capture!!</td>', 'Love the composition and the colors.  They look so relaxed!!  Excellent capture!!', '2004-10-08 00:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(949613, 109604, 18505, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Excellent expression, light, and composition.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this.  Excellent expression, light, and composition.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-08 00:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(949618, 109535, 18505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  I bet it took a lot of stalking to find them.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  I bet it took a lot of stalking to find them.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-08 00:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(949621, 109663, 18505, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color and composition.  Good luck in the challenge!!</td>', 'Gorgeous color and composition.  Good luck in the challenge!!', '2004-10-08 00:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(949876, 109480, 22042, '<td valign="top">great pic</td>', 'great pic', '2004-10-08 02:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(950067, 109395, 16004, '<td valign="top">Bit of a silly title, really, but forgetting that, this is a terrific picture.  the camels face has heaps (well, humps) of personality which I find is quite a rare thing in wildlife shots.  Lighting and composition is top notch as well.  detail such as fur and eyelashes is nice and sharp, and in terms of hanging on a wallability, i would say this does a superb job.  one of my favourites of the week.  10.</td>', 'Bit of a silly title, really, but forgetting that, this is a terrific picture.  the camels face has heaps (well, humps) of personality which I find is quite a rare thing in wildlife shots.  Lighting and composition is top notch as well.  detail such as fur and eyelashes is nice and sharp, and in terms of hanging on a wallability, i would say this does a superb job.  one of my favourites of the week.  10.', '2004-10-08 07:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(950069, 109745, 16004, '<td valign="top">The bird appears a little grey / washed out - maybe a quick blast with the contrast might bring him out a little bit.  it being a members challenge, i might have been tempted to clone out the uppermost part of the trees, as they''re not particularly well captured and are a bit distracting.  it''s also a bit of a pity you couldn''t get closer, because he looks lovely.  5.</td>', 'The bird appears a little grey / washed out - maybe a quick blast with the contrast might bring him out a little bit.  it being a members challenge, i might have been tempted to clone out the uppermost part of the trees, as they''re not particularly well captured and are a bit distracting.  it''s also a bit of a pity you couldn''t get closer, because he looks lovely.  5.', '2004-10-08 07:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(950072, 109795, 16004, '<td valign="top">excellent depth of field, beautiful detail / colour on the birds eye, weird bonkers beak, and very nice composition.  a seemingly boring subject done exceptionally well and interesting to view.  so much detail and wonderful sharpness.  9.</td>', 'excellent depth of field, beautiful detail / colour on the birds eye, weird bonkers beak, and very nice composition.  a seemingly boring subject done exceptionally well and interesting to view.  so much detail and wonderful sharpness.  9.', '2004-10-08 07:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(950077, 109648, 16004, '<td valign="top">he looks lovely.  a bit like a cow pat, but still, lovely.  very very nice job on the focus, but i think the lighting is marginally bit harsh...  it''s a cute shot though - 6.</td>', 'he looks lovely.  a bit like a cow pat, but still, lovely.  very very nice job on the focus, but i think the lighting is marginally bit harsh...  it''s a cute shot though - 6.', '2004-10-08 07:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(950108, 109515, 16004, '<td valign="top">Tigers are dignified, majestic and violently dangerous animals.  You''ve made him look like an old soppy!  And bravo!  the only that might improve the overall image would be the tigers location - a bit of light on him would have been good, but seeing as he probably would not be co-operative after a shove, you probably had to make do.  it''s a lovely taken shot, and encourages a smile.  8.</td>', 'Tigers are dignified, majestic and violently dangerous animals.  You''ve made him look like an old soppy!  And bravo!  the only that might improve the overall image would be the tigers location - a bit of light on him would have been good, but seeing as he probably would not be co-operative after a shove, you probably had to make do.  it''s a lovely taken shot, and encourages a smile.  8.', '2004-10-08 09:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(950110, 109435, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is very good - the side profile works very well - almost like one portion of darwins accent of man type thing.  his black fur against the grey stone works exceedingly well, and the composition works.  excellent - 10.</td>', 'this is very good - the side profile works very well - almost like one portion of darwins accent of man type thing.  his black fur against the grey stone works exceedingly well, and the composition works.  excellent - 10.', '2004-10-08 09:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(950271, 109799, 18799, '<td valign="top">Natural habitat?  <br/> <br/>edit: came back to bump score after learning that this could be considered natural habitat for these animals</td>', 'Natural habitat?   edit: came back to bump score after learning that this could be considered natural habitat for these animals', '2004-10-08 11:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(950276, 108439, 18799, '<td valign="top">What an opportune catch. Nice work!</td>', 'What an opportune catch. Nice work!', '2004-10-08 11:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(950278, 109272, 18799, '<td valign="top">Really nicely exposed and good focus.  What keeps me from voting it higher is that (IMO) the composition is a little weak.  Dead center in the frame doesn''t give me anywhere else to look around in the photo or to add to the "story" of what the squirrel is doing.   5</td>', 'Really nicely exposed and good focus.  What keeps me from voting it higher is that (IMO) the composition is a little weak.  Dead center in the frame doesn''t give me anywhere else to look around in the photo or to add to the "story" of what the squirrel is doing.   5', '2004-10-08 11:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(950285, 108278, 18799, '<td valign="top">To me, the head looks a little odd just poking out like this.  The crop is not tight enough to be a "portrait" but too tight to get a sense of the animal in it''s environment - it''s kind of in a no-man''s land for me.  In addition. the focus is a little off on this one.   I''m giving it a 4</td>', 'To me, the head looks a little odd just poking out like this.  The crop is not tight enough to be a "portrait" but too tight to get a sense of the animal in it''s environment - it''s kind of in a no-man''s land for me.  In addition. the focus is a little off on this one.   I''m giving it a 4', '2004-10-08 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(950288, 108583, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice effort.  What keeps me from voting it higher than a 6 is the blown highlights on the back (a difficult challenge, I know)</td>', 'Nice effort.  What keeps me from voting it higher than a 6 is the blown highlights on the back (a difficult challenge, I know)', '2004-10-08 12:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(950290, 109602, 18799, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, but the bright, blown-out background is a killer for me.   4</td>', 'Cute photo, but the bright, blown-out background is a killer for me.   4', '2004-10-08 12:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(950292, 109424, 18799, '<td valign="top">The image is too much in the center of the frame, which makes it somewhat boring to look at.  The animals are not in very good focus either.  Better luck next challenge.  4</td>', 'The image is too much in the center of the frame, which makes it somewhat boring to look at.  The animals are not in very good focus either.  Better luck next challenge.  4', '2004-10-08 12:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(950296, 109604, 18799, '<td valign="top">Terrific in every way<br/> <br/>Returning for additional comments:  The one thing that bothers me is that this wouldn''t usually be a natural position for an American toad - being terrestrial in nature.  Did you find him like this, and if not how did you get him to stay there?  The way the belly skin is up over the wood suggests that it was placed there from above.   I still like the photo though and am giving it a 10</td>', 'Terrific in every way Returning for additional comments:  The one thing that bothers me is that this wouldn''t usually be a natural position for an American toad - being terrestrial in nature.  Did you find him like this, and if not how did you get him to stay there?  The way the belly skin is up over the wood suggests that it was placed there from above.   I still like the photo though and am giving it a 10', '2004-10-08 12:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(950326, 109298, 16739, '<td valign="top">very good , 7          looked at this again and had to change it to a 9  good luck ,</td>', 'very good , 7          looked at this again and had to change it to a 9  good luck ,', '2004-10-08 12:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(950336, 109643, 2310, '<td valign="top">Really nice color...great expression...great composition...not sure if you could do anything about the darker area on the right which is taking my attention away from the subject...maybe darken the left side?  Either way...great picture!</td>', 'Really nice color...great expression...great composition...not sure if you could do anything about the darker area on the right which is taking my attention away from the subject...maybe darken the left side?  Either way...great picture!', '2004-10-08 12:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(950346, 108557, 2310, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp capture of a wild animal...I wish the background was a litte more blurred to hightlight the animal or to express the movement that is occurring...</td>', 'Nice sharp capture of a wild animal...I wish the background was a litte more blurred to hightlight the animal or to express the movement that is occurring...', '2004-10-08 12:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(950526, 109140, 2337, '<td valign="top">They are certainly mammals :)  I''m sure your getting hammered because of the "non-domesticated" part, but I have daughters so I know where you''re coming from :)  The head in the background is a little bit of a distraction, as are the windows...  Keep your chin up, this is going to be a long week for you full of low scores and hate-comments from folks that have no sense of humor or hate kids... Pay them no mind... It''s a nice shot and a interesting slant on the challenge.  If my membership becomes active before the voting ends, I''ll give you extra credit for courage :)  <br/>Note : Membership became active :)</td>', 'They are certainly mammals :)  I''m sure your getting hammered because of the "non-domesticated" part, but I have daughters so I know where you''re coming from :)  The head in the background is a little bit of a distraction, as are the windows...  Keep your chin up, this is going to be a long week for you full of low scores and hate-comments from folks that have no sense of humor or hate kids... Pay them no mind... It''s a nice shot and a interesting slant on the challenge.  If my membership becomes active before the voting ends, I''ll give you extra credit for courage :)  Note : Membership became active :)', '2004-10-08 15:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
