(950586, 109673, 2337, '<td valign="top">At first glance I was going to say you didn''t meet the challenge, but I always look long and hard before I do that.  It took a while, but I get it  :)  very subtle and technically doesn''t meet the challenge, but I think it''s a valid and very creative interpetation :)<br/> <br/>On a side note, it''s a wonderfully composed shot... The shadow in the upper left is a little distracting, but some things can''t be controlled...</td>', 'At first glance I was going to say you didn''t meet the challenge, but I always look long and hard before I do that.  It took a while, but I get it  :)  very subtle and technically doesn''t meet the challenge, but I think it''s a valid and very creative interpetation :) On a side note, it''s a wonderfully composed shot... The shadow in the upper left is a little distracting, but some things can''t be controlled...', '2004-10-08 16:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(950607, 108632, 6388, '<td valign="top">wish we all had the opportunity to shoot such a beast outside of a zoo...unfortunately, this may be overlooked in comparison to the photos of the captive ones.  nice clarity and sharpness.  a little creative dodging and a slightly tighter crop to get rid of the unneccesary space on the right and this moves up about .5-1 point in the votes i would guess.  very nice.  wish i was there.</td>', 'wish we all had the opportunity to shoot such a beast outside of a zoo...unfortunately, this may be overlooked in comparison to the photos of the captive ones.  nice clarity and sharpness.  a little creative dodging and a slightly tighter crop to get rid of the unneccesary space on the right and this moves up about .5-1 point in the votes i would guess.  very nice.  wish i was there.', '2004-10-08 16:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(950613, 109518, 6388, '<td valign="top">the lighting is a little flat, so a bit of push in the contrast post-processing could compensate.  very well executed; nice crop, nice choice of shallow depth.  good attention to detail.</td>', 'the lighting is a little flat, so a bit of push in the contrast post-processing could compensate.  very well executed; nice crop, nice choice of shallow depth.  good attention to detail.', '2004-10-08 16:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(950916, 109610, 17033, '<td valign="top">love the water and its contrast with the heron</td>', 'love the water and its contrast with the heron', '2004-10-08 19:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(950921, 109487, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great capture but perhaps not presented to its best capability. Not sure about the halo glow which emphasises the dark head and perhaps the position in the frame is too centred. Despite this, love the form!</td>', 'Great capture but perhaps not presented to its best capability. Not sure about the halo glow which emphasises the dark head and perhaps the position in the frame is too centred. Despite this, love the form!', '2004-10-08 19:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(950938, 109451, 17033, '<td valign="top">Fantastic sharpness around the eye but I have to wonder if the stick needed to be in the frame. A simple crop could have really kept the viewer''s focus on the bird''s gaze.</td>', 'Fantastic sharpness around the eye but I have to wonder if the stick needed to be in the frame. A simple crop could have really kept the viewer''s focus on the bird''s gaze.', '2004-10-08 19:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(950952, 109648, 17033, '<td valign="top">Closer shot (or crop) would have made it more interesting</td>', 'Closer shot (or crop) would have made it more interesting', '2004-10-08 19:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(950956, 109639, 17033, '<td valign="top">Essence of bird-flight captured well. Very creative.</td>', 'Essence of bird-flight captured well. Very creative.', '2004-10-08 19:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(950960, 109673, 17033, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit like a dog paw-print! Cheeky entry that would fare well in another challenge. Perhaps too much shadow on the left.</td>', 'Looks a bit like a dog paw-print! Cheeky entry that would fare well in another challenge. Perhaps too much shadow on the left.', '2004-10-08 19:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(950961, 109251, 22781, '<td valign="top">Very sharp. Nice use of DOF.<br/>Could it be improved? I guess yes..<br/>The feathers in his/her neck are a bit blown out...<br/>Nice picture overall. In my top 3!</td>', 'Very sharp. Nice use of DOF.Could it be improved? I guess yes..The feathers in his/her neck are a bit blown out...Nice picture overall. In my top 3!', '2004-10-08 19:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(950966, 109323, 22781, '<td valign="top">Very pretty model...<br/>Like the use of duotone here..</td>', 'Very pretty model...Like the use of duotone here..', '2004-10-08 19:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(950967, 108800, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous birds, their color is wonderful, and they do make for a great subject!  I''m probably asking the impossible, but would have liked to have seen a tighter shot, with shallow dof, the entire background is so "busy" that it distracts my eyes considerably.  If nothing else, then a tighter crop to make the birds appear to be the main subject rather than a "part of a bigger picture".</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous birds, their color is wonderful, and they do make for a great subject!  I''m probably asking the impossible, but would have liked to have seen a tighter shot, with shallow dof, the entire background is so "busy" that it distracts my eyes considerably.  If nothing else, then a tighter crop to make the birds appear to be the main subject rather than a "part of a bigger picture".', '2004-10-08 19:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(950971, 109195, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the composition setup/angle, but part of the little guy is so fuzzy that it becomes almost un-noticeable, and his head is fading off into the background enough that he doesn''t really hold his own in the composition, it''s easy to get distracted from him by the sharp difference in the light/dark areas.  I would like to have seen more of his head in the light, with a good sharp focus on his beady little eyes so he would really stand out from his surroundings.</td>', 'I like the composition setup/angle, but part of the little guy is so fuzzy that it becomes almost un-noticeable, and his head is fading off into the background enough that he doesn''t really hold his own in the composition, it''s easy to get distracted from him by the sharp difference in the light/dark areas.  I would like to have seen more of his head in the light, with a good sharp focus on his beady little eyes so he would really stand out from his surroundings.', '2004-10-08 19:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(950974, 109673, 2553, '<td valign="top">Compositionally very nice, with wonderful texture and contrasts to feast the eyes on!</td>', 'Compositionally very nice, with wonderful texture and contrasts to feast the eyes on!', '2004-10-08 19:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(950975, 109454, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice color and interesting, but for me, has a "wallpapery" feel to it.  Would love to have seen more of the giraffe''s "personality"!</td>', 'Nice color and interesting, but for me, has a "wallpapery" feel to it.  Would love to have seen more of the giraffe''s "personality"!', '2004-10-08 19:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(950979, 109122, 2553, '<td valign="top">Gives me chills to look at him - looks kinda like a fire ant.  Background definitely is distracting to me, and wonder what it would have looked like with a lot of it cropped out.</td>', 'Gives me chills to look at him - looks kinda like a fire ant.  Background definitely is distracting to me, and wonder what it would have looked like with a lot of it cropped out.', '2004-10-08 19:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(950980, 109775, 2553, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, bad lighting situation.  Surroundings are a little distracting.</td>', 'Cool shot, bad lighting situation.  Surroundings are a little distracting.', '2004-10-08 19:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(950982, 109504, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good catch with the wings up, I''m jealous!  He sort of blends into and out of the background, but a cool shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Good catch with the wings up, I''m jealous!  He sort of blends into and out of the background, but a cool shot nonetheless.', '2004-10-08 19:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(950986, 109651, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, now THAT''S wildlife!  And too close for comfort too.  Pretty cool looking, wish there was a "catchlight" in his eyeball, (or maybe I''m just missing it).</td>', 'Wow, now THAT''S wildlife!  And too close for comfort too.  Pretty cool looking, wish there was a "catchlight" in his eyeball, (or maybe I''m just missing it).', '2004-10-08 19:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(950987, 108632, 2553, '<td valign="top">WHERE do YOU live???  Awesome shot, great lighting, dof works well for me, I really like this.</td>', 'WHERE do YOU live???  Awesome shot, great lighting, dof works well for me, I really like this.', '2004-10-08 19:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(950990, 108189, 2553, '<td valign="top">OOH yeah.  Terrific shot, and what about those thorns??  Like the composition very much, as well as your subject.</td>', 'OOH yeah.  Terrific shot, and what about those thorns??  Like the composition very much, as well as your subject.', '2004-10-08 19:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(950994, 109492, 2553, '<td valign="top">Cool, love it, but the brightness of the pink definitely draws my eye away from the subject.  Would like to have seen a crop.</td>', 'Cool, love it, but the brightness of the pink definitely draws my eye away from the subject.  Would like to have seen a crop.', '2004-10-08 19:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(950995, 108898, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Composition is perfect for me, everything works together wonderfully.</td>', 'Love this shot.  Composition is perfect for me, everything works together wonderfully.', '2004-10-08 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(950996, 109386, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, would like to have seen it cropped to portrait, emphasizing the egret and reflection more as well as effectively cutting down on the distracting background at the top.</td>', 'Very nice shot, would like to have seen it cropped to portrait, emphasizing the egret and reflection more as well as effectively cutting down on the distracting background at the top.', '2004-10-08 19:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(950997, 109638, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Do you work for Field and Stream?</td>', 'Beautiful.  Do you work for Field and Stream?', '2004-10-08 19:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(950999, 109451, 2553, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot. One of my favs so far, very well done with great lighting and composition. Was this REALLY taken "in the wild"?? Great photo.</td>', 'Amazing shot. One of my favs so far, very well done with great lighting and composition. Was this REALLY taken "in the wild"?? Great photo.', '2004-10-08 19:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(951001, 109734, 2553, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, with pleasing color, but the composition just doesn''t seem dynamic enough to give that "something special".</td>', 'A nice shot, with pleasing color, but the composition just doesn''t seem dynamic enough to give that "something special".', '2004-10-08 19:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(951004, 109668, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m clicking through here, voting on photos, and this totally stops me in my tracks.  An absolutely stunning image, I can''t take my eyes off it.  It''s like a gathering of angels or something.  I''d give you a 12 if I could.</td>', 'I''m clicking through here, voting on photos, and this totally stops me in my tracks.  An absolutely stunning image, I can''t take my eyes off it.  It''s like a gathering of angels or something.  I''d give you a 12 if I could.', '2004-10-08 19:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(951009, 108439, 17033, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition and mood. Faun a little bit soft</td>', 'Perfect composition and mood. Faun a little bit soft', '2004-10-08 20:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(951038, 109640, 14863, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful- I love the texture, how you can just feel the fur and colors are just so inviting. I love the bold and stern expression the tiger has- great DOF, just great, awesome! 10</td>', 'This is beautiful- I love the texture, how you can just feel the fur and colors are just so inviting. I love the bold and stern expression the tiger has- great DOF, just great, awesome! 10', '2004-10-08 20:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(951042, 109615, 14863, '<td valign="top">This is really cool- the light illuminating the animal is just like a halo, it''s beautiful. The texture''s amazing and the expression''s hilarious, great job! 10</td>', 'This is really cool- the light illuminating the animal is just like a halo, it''s beautiful. The texture''s amazing and the expression''s hilarious, great job! 10', '2004-10-08 20:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(951044, 109395, 14863, '<td valign="top">Haha! I love how there''s so much negative space and the sky is just such a deep blue. The texture is amazing and the colors are perfect. That expression is priceless, awesome! 10</td>', 'Haha! I love how there''s so much negative space and the sky is just such a deep blue. The texture is amazing and the colors are perfect. That expression is priceless, awesome! 10', '2004-10-08 20:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(951045, 109744, 6008, '<td valign="top">The texture on the beak is really good. The main problem here is the lighting. although you got good lighting on the beak and the top part of the head the side is really dark and you''ve completely lost the eye to darkness. As with human portraits, the eyes are a key feature to show life. It looks like you also have some purple fringing at the top, liking from the extremes of dark and light.</td>', 'The texture on the beak is really good. The main problem here is the lighting. although you got good lighting on the beak and the top part of the head the side is really dark and you''ve completely lost the eye to darkness. As with human portraits, the eyes are a key feature to show life. It looks like you also have some purple fringing at the top, liking from the extremes of dark and light.', '2004-10-08 20:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(951241, 109290, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture in a natural setting. I like this a lot as it looks so REAL. I tried to take a picture of a grouse that I found in the forest and I could never get a good shot. Your three turkeys are great!</td>', 'Very nice capture in a natural setting. I like this a lot as it looks so REAL. I tried to take a picture of a grouse that I found in the forest and I could never get a good shot. Your three turkeys are great!', '2004-10-08 22:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(951243, 109671, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice clear, well composed picture. This is really a cute little chipmunk, he/she posed very nicely for you.</td>', 'Very nice clear, well composed picture. This is really a cute little chipmunk, he/she posed very nicely for you.', '2004-10-08 22:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(951246, 108557, 18552, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. I really like the implied motion in your shot - I keep waiting for this elk to take another step! Very nice colors and composition.</td>', 'Lovely picture. I really like the implied motion in your shot - I keep waiting for this elk to take another step! Very nice colors and composition.', '2004-10-08 23:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(951249, 109638, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. I like the way her coat blends into the grass and shows the natural camouflage that deer have in nature.</td>', 'Very nice picture. I like the way her coat blends into the grass and shows the natural camouflage that deer have in nature.', '2004-10-08 23:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(951265, 108484, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a cute little budgie! I had a sweet little budgie for 7 years until he passed away. It would be nice to live somewhere they were wild. Your picture is really good, the colors are great and the composition is good, too. I like the blurred background.</td>', 'What a cute little budgie! I had a sweet little budgie for 7 years until he passed away. It would be nice to live somewhere they were wild. Your picture is really good, the colors are great and the composition is good, too. I like the blurred background.', '2004-10-08 23:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(951267, 109469, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice squirrel picture, the colors are very nice. I think I would have enjoyed it more if you could have seen more of her, the crop seems a bit tight.</td>', 'Very nice squirrel picture, the colors are very nice. I think I would have enjoyed it more if you could have seen more of her, the crop seems a bit tight.', '2004-10-08 23:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(951271, 109333, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture looks a bit blurry but the colors and composition are very good. I can''t tell if you wanted this blurry effect or not. To me, it would have been nicer if the focus was a bit sharper - however, I know it is very hard to get a good focus on something that can run away so quickly!</td>', 'Your picture looks a bit blurry but the colors and composition are very good. I can''t tell if you wanted this blurry effect or not. To me, it would have been nicer if the focus was a bit sharper - however, I know it is very hard to get a good focus on something that can run away so quickly!', '2004-10-08 23:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(951275, 109308, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, the colors and the look of the water are great. It might have been nice if the background birds hadn''t been chopped off, if more of them were showing. Of course, this might not have been possible so I hope it doesn''t upset you that I said this.</td>', 'Very nice picture, the colors and the look of the water are great. It might have been nice if the background birds hadn''t been chopped off, if more of them were showing. Of course, this might not have been possible so I hope it doesn''t upset you that I said this.', '2004-10-08 23:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(951278, 109239, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really a cute picture. I wish people looked so cute when they were this plump!</td>', 'Really a cute picture. I wish people looked so cute when they were this plump!', '2004-10-08 23:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(951287, 109518, 24896, '<td valign="top">great capture....very robert bateman</td>', 'great capture....very robert bateman', '2004-10-08 23:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(951292, 108898, 24896, '<td valign="top">I love this shot......I don''t give out 10''s very often...but this gets one...just awesome</td>', 'I love this shot......I don''t give out 10''s very often...but this gets one...just awesome', '2004-10-08 23:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(951295, 108439, 24896, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot...the focus is just a little off or it would be a 10...still a 9 for an awesome capture</td>', 'I really like this shot...the focus is just a little off or it would be a 10...still a 9 for an awesome capture', '2004-10-08 23:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(951298, 109756, 24896, '<td valign="top">love this shot...wish I was there with you...10... and not a zoo pic too...awesome</td>', 'love this shot...wish I was there with you...10... and not a zoo pic too...awesome', '2004-10-08 23:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(951307, 109668, 27518, '<td valign="top">The colors, texture and subject are wonderful.  This is a great picture.  It does need to have less negative space on the bottom cropped, or, an equal amount of skyline above to add balance.  Cropped just a few inches below the last bird would have made this a 10 in my opinion.</td>', 'The colors, texture and subject are wonderful.  This is a great picture.  It does need to have less negative space on the bottom cropped, or, an equal amount of skyline above to add balance.  Cropped just a few inches below the last bird would have made this a 10 in my opinion.', '2004-10-08 23:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(951321, 109789, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. The beak and eyes are well focused but the feathers seem quite blurry. It looks like they might have lost some detail in some way.</td>', 'Very nice picture. The beak and eyes are well focused but the feathers seem quite blurry. It looks like they might have lost some detail in some way.', '2004-10-09 00:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(951322, 109639, 18552, '<td valign="top">Your picture does really have a nice airy feel to it. To my eyes, it might have been a bit better if the bird had been a bit more clearly defined with not quite as much motion blur.</td>', 'Your picture does really have a nice airy feel to it. To my eyes, it might have been a bit better if the bird had been a bit more clearly defined with not quite as much motion blur.', '2004-10-09 00:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(951323, 108898, 18552, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge. I love the look on the owl''s face. Some of the old buildings around here have owls in them but I''ve never been able to get a picture of one. Great job!</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge. I love the look on the owl''s face. Some of the old buildings around here have owls in them but I''ve never been able to get a picture of one. Great job!', '2004-10-09 00:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(951326, 109272, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very cute picture of a squirrel in it''s natural environment. It might have been nice to crop it so the squirrel ended up more to the left in the frame.</td>', 'Very cute picture of a squirrel in it''s natural environment. It might have been nice to crop it so the squirrel ended up more to the left in the frame.', '2004-10-09 00:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(951339, 109122, 16965, '<td valign="top">I know you''ve gotten the comment.... but, no insects :(  great capture, though!</td>', 'I know you''ve gotten the comment.... but, no insects :(  great capture, though!', '2004-10-09 00:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(951342, 109796, 16965, '<td valign="top">I know you''ve gotten the comment.... but, no insects :(</td>', 'I know you''ve gotten the comment.... but, no insects :(', '2004-10-09 00:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(951434, 109638, 25464, '<td valign="top">Appears to be a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Appears to be a bit oversharpened.', '2004-10-09 02:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(951440, 108898, 10263, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Love the negative space in the window.</td>', 'I really like this. Love the negative space in the window.', '2004-10-09 02:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(951442, 109643, 10263, '<td valign="top">Very regal. I like how he blends in with the background and the fact that hes looking right into my eyes.</td>', 'Very regal. I like how he blends in with the background and the fact that hes looking right into my eyes.', '2004-10-09 02:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(951444, 109760, 25464, '<td valign="top">I really like this artistic approach to the challenge.  It may suffer the wrath of the narrow minded voters since a human is in the shot.  The only thing I would change about this shot would be to frame it with a less centered horizon.  Good Job.</td>', 'I really like this artistic approach to the challenge.  It may suffer the wrath of the narrow minded voters since a human is in the shot.  The only thing I would change about this shot would be to frame it with a less centered horizon.  Good Job.', '2004-10-09 02:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(951447, 109140, 12253, '<td valign="top">Cute shot; very good technically, though I think the composition is too tight on the top, and the shadow figure upper left is distracting enough that I would have cloned it out.  These comments notwithstanding, I don''t see this meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Cute shot; very good technically, though I think the composition is too tight on the top, and the shadow figure upper left is distracting enough that I would have cloned it out.  These comments notwithstanding, I don''t see this meeting the challenge.', '2004-10-09 02:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(951449, 109615, 10263, '<td valign="top">Precious, precious.. one of my favorite animals. The backlighting is wonderful</td>', 'Precious, precious.. one of my favorite animals. The backlighting is wonderful', '2004-10-09 02:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(951451, 109799, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s quite a sight, but of course technically this photo suffers from the angle relative to  the animals, and the blown out background.  I think a tight crop would have been better than including the background , especially on the right.</td>', 'Well, it''s quite a sight, but of course technically this photo suffers from the angle relative to  the animals, and the blown out background.  I think a tight crop would have been better than including the background , especially on the right.', '2004-10-09 02:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(951452, 109789, 10263, '<td valign="top">His expression is wonderful. Wish there was more detail in his feathers.</td>', 'His expression is wonderful. Wish there was more detail in his feathers.', '2004-10-09 02:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(951454, 109577, 12253, '<td valign="top">A good capture of the duck/goose but the PS work on the sky is too obvious and detracts from this otherwise interesting photo.  Also, ignoring the sky for a bit, a faster shutter speed would have frozen the wings better (though some may like the sense of motion , to me they just look blurry.</td>', 'A good capture of the duck/goose but the PS work on the sky is too obvious and detracts from this otherwise interesting photo.  Also, ignoring the sky for a bit, a faster shutter speed would have frozen the wings better (though some may like the sense of motion , to me they just look blurry.', '2004-10-09 02:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(951458, 109673, 12253, '<td valign="top">Really a nice photo--I like the diagonal composition.  The leaves in the mud are a worthy photo by themsekves.  Is that a starfish or something in the water--it''s too dark for me to tell.  It would have been good to use a reflector here to get rid of the shadow over the water.</td>', 'Really a nice photo--I like the diagonal composition.  The leaves in the mud are a worthy photo by themsekves.  Is that a starfish or something in the water--it''s too dark for me to tell.  It would have been good to use a reflector here to get rid of the shadow over the water.', '2004-10-09 02:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(951459, 109668, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is a definate WOW.  He certainly looks like a maestro. Love the colors and the negative space.</td>', 'This is a definate WOW.  He certainly looks like a maestro. Love the colors and the negative space.', '2004-10-09 02:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(951461, 108464, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is potentially an interesting shot, but the foreground blurred flowers are too distracting.  What''s your subject here?  Note that the challenge was wildlife, not wildflowers.</td>', 'This is potentially an interesting shot, but the foreground blurred flowers are too distracting.  What''s your subject here?  Note that the challenge was wildlife, not wildflowers.', '2004-10-09 02:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(951480, 109743, 2337, '<td valign="top">I know you''ve already heard this more than you care to, but the wording of the challange was very specific... It''s a nice insect shot, but that isn''t the challenge... Also I''d have liked to see either more or less of the legs... The current cropping doesn''t work for me...  But that''s just me :) <br/>Note : If you can document that this creature fits into the challenge, please email me and I''ll reconsider my vote... myqyl@e-clark.us</td>', 'I know you''ve already heard this more than you care to, but the wording of the challange was very specific... It''s a nice insect shot, but that isn''t the challenge... Also I''d have liked to see either more or less of the legs... The current cropping doesn''t work for me...  But that''s just me :) Note : If you can document that this creature fits into the challenge, please email me and I''ll reconsider my vote... myqyl@e-clark.us', '2004-10-09 03:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(951481, 108672, 2337, '<td valign="top">Not being a scientist, I''m going to give you the benefit of the doubt that this guy fits the challenge :)  Nice work</td>', 'Not being a scientist, I''m going to give you the benefit of the doubt that this guy fits the challenge :)  Nice work', '2004-10-09 04:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(951533, 108898, 12131, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  The way cracks and plaster show and the age of the wood, coupled with your titled addage make this one of my favorites.</td>', 'Love this shot.  The way cracks and plaster show and the age of the wood, coupled with your titled addage make this one of my favorites.', '2004-10-09 06:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(951536, 108778, 12131, '<td valign="top">Those birds look possitively started.  It''s amusing.  Beautiful as well.</td>', 'Those birds look possitively started.  It''s amusing.  Beautiful as well.', '2004-10-09 06:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(951540, 109452, 12131, '<td valign="top">So peaceful, strong colors,  soothing ripples, great border choice.</td>', 'So peaceful, strong colors,  soothing ripples, great border choice.', '2004-10-09 06:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(951543, 109066, 12131, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous back lighting.</td>', 'Gorgeous back lighting.', '2004-10-09 06:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(951545, 109327, 12131, '<td valign="top">You actually make this bird look regal.  Excellent shot.  The only thing I don''t like are the other prints in the sand, but then an untouched beach is hard to find these days.</td>', 'You actually make this bird look regal.  Excellent shot.  The only thing I don''t like are the other prints in the sand, but then an untouched beach is hard to find these days.', '2004-10-09 06:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(951546, 109643, 12131, '<td valign="top">Ooohhh she''s just begging you to try something.  Lovely image.</td>', 'Ooohhh she''s just begging you to try something.  Lovely image.', '2004-10-09 06:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(951547, 109760, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, the choice of black and white and the pattern in the sand and sea are excellent.  I would only have taken out the human.  I think it distracts from the shot.  Great focul point though.</td>', 'I like this shot, the choice of black and white and the pattern in the sand and sea are excellent.  I would only have taken out the human.  I think it distracts from the shot.  Great focul point though.', '2004-10-09 06:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(951548, 109650, 12131, '<td valign="top">I love that the bird could almost be standing on it''s tail.  Good look about it. 7</td>', 'I love that the bird could almost be standing on it''s tail.  Good look about it. 7', '2004-10-09 06:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(951551, 109623, 12131, '<td valign="top">You know the fellow on the left draws my attention the most.  I would almost have thought he was feeling guilt or sorrow about something by the closed eyes and the hunched posture.  Their both adorable.</td>', 'You know the fellow on the left draws my attention the most.  I would almost have thought he was feeling guilt or sorrow about something by the closed eyes and the hunched posture.  Their both adorable.', '2004-10-09 06:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(951553, 108812, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the 3 ducks, though, they seem a little bit out of focus. I would either crop a bit on the top, or leave more water plants there. Some more lighting on the ducks'' heads and the log would be fine, too.</td>', 'I like the composition with the 3 ducks, though, they seem a little bit out of focus. I would either crop a bit on the top, or leave more water plants there. Some more lighting on the ducks'' heads and the log would be fine, too.', '2004-10-09 06:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(951555, 108583, 10858, '<td valign="top">WOWnderful colours, and reflection, very well exposed whites! Just one issue: the head should be more in focus or sharper... I guess she was quite far from you, they are very coward animals and they are hard to approach.</td>', 'WOWnderful colours, and reflection, very well exposed whites! Just one issue: the head should be more in focus or sharper... I guess she was quite far from you, they are very coward animals and they are hard to approach.', '2004-10-09 06:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(951558, 109706, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love tigers! WOWnderful colours, I also love the composition and the expression on his face. Very well done, good luck! :-) (10)</td>', 'I love tigers! WOWnderful colours, I also love the composition and the expression on his face. Very well done, good luck! :-) (10)', '2004-10-09 06:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(951561, 109748, 10858, '<td valign="top">LOL! :-) Funny and natural. Great compositin and colours, too. :-) I may have cropped a very little bit on the bottom, but I am not sure whether it''s neccessary.</td>', 'LOL! :-) Funny and natural. Great compositin and colours, too. :-) I may have cropped a very little bit on the bottom, but I am not sure whether it''s neccessary.', '2004-10-09 06:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(951562, 109589, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, though, the texture of this bird needs a shallower DOF, this way the texture of the background is a bit busy for me. The eye and the head could be a bit more sharper, but I like the way she holds her head.</td>', 'Nice composition, though, the texture of this bird needs a shallower DOF, this way the texture of the background is a bit busy for me. The eye and the head could be a bit more sharper, but I like the way she holds her head.', '2004-10-09 06:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(951565, 109751, 10858, '<td valign="top">Loveable greens and textures. :-) I like the greens and pinks and the colour of the background, excellent DOF and exposure. Good luck. :-) (10)</td>', 'Loveable greens and textures. :-) I like the greens and pinks and the colour of the background, excellent DOF and exposure. Good luck. :-) (10)', '2004-10-09 06:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(951567, 108434, 10858, '<td valign="top">The lighting is mystical, but the main subject is way too unsharp for me. :-( Looks like a dirty aquarium, and blurred... sorry, I can''t really enjoy the view here...</td>', 'The lighting is mystical, but the main subject is way too unsharp for me. :-( Looks like a dirty aquarium, and blurred... sorry, I can''t really enjoy the view here...', '2004-10-09 06:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(951568, 108890, 10858, '<td valign="top">This is cute. :-) Excellent DOF, I also like the composition. King Kong was a successful movie, what about King Corn for the next time? :-)</td>', 'This is cute. :-) Excellent DOF, I also like the composition. King Kong was a successful movie, what about King Corn for the next time? :-)', '2004-10-09 06:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(951570, 109576, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great colours, DOF and lighting. :-) The image could be a bit bigger, but I like what I see.</td>', 'Great colours, DOF and lighting. :-) The image could be a bit bigger, but I like what I see.', '2004-10-09 06:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(951574, 109140, 10858, '<td valign="top">The photo itself is very well done, but seeing the tile, I still don''t think it fits the challenge. "For the purpose of this challenge, "wildlife" should be considered non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment." This is a guality photo for candid or family, but I don''t think this would do well in this challenge.</td>', 'The photo itself is very well done, but seeing the tile, I still don''t think it fits the challenge. "For the purpose of this challenge, "wildlife" should be considered non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment." This is a guality photo for candid or family, but I don''t think this would do well in this challenge.', '2004-10-09 06:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(951594, 109571, 7743, '<td valign="top">The composition and the tones chosen are nice, however the glow doesn''t seem natural and therefore the image appears to be overprocessed.</td>', 'The composition and the tones chosen are nice, however the glow doesn''t seem natural and therefore the image appears to be overprocessed.', '2004-10-09 07:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(951595, 109294, 7743, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a wonderful job of capturing the expression of the Orangutan.  Great catch light in the eyes.  The only thing is I think it needs a little more DOF so the entire face is in focus and not just the eyes.  Well done. 9</td>', 'You''ve done a wonderful job of capturing the expression of the Orangutan.  Great catch light in the eyes.  The only thing is I think it needs a little more DOF so the entire face is in focus and not just the eyes.  Well done. 9', '2004-10-09 07:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(951598, 109469, 7743, '<td valign="top">Great pose.  Unfortunately the focus is on the tail.</td>', 'Great pose.  Unfortunately the focus is on the tail.', '2004-10-09 08:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(951600, 108898, 7743, '<td valign="top">The composition here is amazing.  The long narrow window draws the viewer''s attention right to the owl.  To me it needs to be a bit brighter.  Fill flash maybe or a little bit of sunlight, just something to brighten it up a bit. 9</td>', 'The composition here is amazing.  The long narrow window draws the viewer''s attention right to the owl.  To me it needs to be a bit brighter.  Fill flash maybe or a little bit of sunlight, just something to brighten it up a bit. 9', '2004-10-09 08:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(951601, 109756, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition.  Just a little more contrast to bring out the bear more I think would make this even better. 8</td>', 'Lovely composition.  Just a little more contrast to bring out the bear more I think would make this even better. 8', '2004-10-09 08:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(951603, 109797, 7743, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition.  It gives a wonderful comparison of size between the squirrel and the tree.  This may have worked better in a vertical composition to emphasize that even more.  Focus on the squirrel seems just a little bit soft.  A little bit more DOF would probably help there.  8</td>', 'I really like this composition.  It gives a wonderful comparison of size between the squirrel and the tree.  This may have worked better in a vertical composition to emphasize that even more.  Focus on the squirrel seems just a little bit soft.  A little bit more DOF would probably help there.  8', '2004-10-09 08:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(951604, 109610, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice heron, however it appears to be way oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice heron, however it appears to be way oversharpened.', '2004-10-09 08:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(951606, 109650, 7743, '<td valign="top">Chickadees are fun to watch.  You''ve captured a nice pose here, however the image appears to be oversharpened.</td>', 'Chickadees are fun to watch.  You''ve captured a nice pose here, however the image appears to be oversharpened.', '2004-10-09 08:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(951609, 109605, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at contrast between the tree and the bird, however the bird appears to be out of focus.</td>', 'Good attempt at contrast between the tree and the bird, however the bird appears to be out of focus.', '2004-10-09 08:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(951621, 109587, 21643, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, great composition and sharpness, and an excellent DOF. Love the bird''s expression, too. If I *had* to pick a fault, I would say that the tip of the beak has a washed-out spot, but honestly, it doesn''t bother me or detract from my overall impression of this photo. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful colors, great composition and sharpness, and an excellent DOF. Love the bird''s expression, too. If I *had* to pick a fault, I would say that the tip of the beak has a washed-out spot, but honestly, it doesn''t bother me or detract from my overall impression of this photo. Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-10-09 09:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(951625, 109710, 21643, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot! Incredible detail and attractive colors. I might have prefered a little bit more space at the top of the photo, but it isn''t a huge concern for me. I really like this photo. Good luck!<br/></td>', 'What a beautiful shot! Incredible detail and attractive colors. I might have prefered a little bit more space at the top of the photo, but it isn''t a huge concern for me. I really like this photo. Good luck!', '2004-10-09 09:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(951657, 109361, 20941, '<td valign="top">love this guys expression!</td>', 'love this guys expression!', '2004-10-09 10:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(951779, 109591, 1031, '<td valign="top">And they say it''s a dog''s life.</td>', 'And they say it''s a dog''s life.', '2004-10-09 13:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(951781, 109648, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of a low-angled shot.</td>', 'I like your choice of a low-angled shot.', '2004-10-09 13:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(951790, 109447, 1031, '<td valign="top">Truly beautiful shot, but for this particular challenge I think we were limited to vertebrates.</td>', 'Truly beautiful shot, but for this particular challenge I think we were limited to vertebrates.', '2004-10-09 13:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(951794, 109164, 1031, '<td valign="top">It is interesting that DPC voters always seem to complain about baby pictures, but I bet they go ape for pictures of baby ANIMALS. I like it too.</td>', 'It is interesting that DPC voters always seem to complain about baby pictures, but I bet they go ape for pictures of baby ANIMALS. I like it too.', '2004-10-09 13:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(951799, 109122, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great shot of a monster ant, but for this particular challenge I think we were limited to vertebrates.</td>', 'Great shot of a monster ant, but for this particular challenge I think we were limited to vertebrates.', '2004-10-09 13:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(951812, 109547, 1031, '<td valign="top">Who''s got some aspirin?</td>', 'Who''s got some aspirin?', '2004-10-09 13:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(951816, 109395, 1031, '<td valign="top">But I bet by now the pension is vested ... enjoy your retirement.</td>', 'But I bet by now the pension is vested ... enjoy your retirement.', '2004-10-09 13:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(951859, 109756, 10208, '<td valign="top">I am an avid hunter and outdoors person and of all the submissions in this challenge I find this to be  one of the most natural settings and captures . The only thing that might have made it a bit better for me would have been if the bear was in front of the rock to make him stand out more. Great shot</td>', 'I am an avid hunter and outdoors person and of all the submissions in this challenge I find this to be  one of the most natural settings and captures . The only thing that might have made it a bit better for me would have been if the bear was in front of the rock to make him stand out more. Great shot', '2004-10-09 14:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(951892, 109615, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is so wonderful.  you captured just enough light in the front to get wonderful detail, like that cute face and the dirt on his paws and the glow from behind is just awesome.  Wonderful shot.</td>', 'This is so wonderful.  you captured just enough light in the front to get wonderful detail, like that cute face and the dirt on his paws and the glow from behind is just awesome.  Wonderful shot.', '2004-10-09 15:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(951895, 109794, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very eye pleasing composition.  Excellent tones.</td>', 'Very eye pleasing composition.  Excellent tones.', '2004-10-09 15:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(951898, 109298, 14620, '<td valign="top">This shot looks like it''s straight out of a magazine.  Wonderful capture, but it''s the colors that amaze me most about this shot.  Great job!</td>', 'This shot looks like it''s straight out of a magazine.  Wonderful capture, but it''s the colors that amaze me most about this shot.  Great job!', '2004-10-09 15:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(951901, 109576, 14484, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, nice close up</td>', 'Nice lighting, nice close up', '2004-10-09 15:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(951903, 109604, 14620, '<td valign="top">What a great little pose!!  Wonderful textures and colors in this shot.  DOF is spot on.  Nice job, bumped to an 8</td>', 'What a great little pose!!  Wonderful textures and colors in this shot.  DOF is spot on.  Nice job, bumped to an 8', '2004-10-09 15:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(951919, 109323, 6597, '<td valign="top">I don''t think people meet the challenge 2<br/> <br/> <br/>I</td>', 'I don''t think people meet the challenge 2  I', '2004-10-09 15:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(951923, 109140, 6597, '<td valign="top">Maybe they get wild as most children do but I don''t think people meet the challenge 2</td>', 'Maybe they get wild as most children do but I don''t think people meet the challenge 2', '2004-10-09 15:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(951930, 108557, 1031, '<td valign="top">Even the antlers blend in with the environment.</td>', 'Even the antlers blend in with the environment.', '2004-10-09 15:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
