(951940, 109341, 1031, '<td valign="top">I hope you have shots covering the eyes and mouth as well : )</td>', 'I hope you have shots covering the eyes and mouth as well : )', '2004-10-09 15:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(951951, 109625, 27573, '<td valign="top">Truly wonderful picture!</td>', 'Truly wonderful picture!', '2004-10-09 15:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(951984, 109515, 27281, '<td valign="top">humorous, but the background is way too bright compared to your subject</td>', 'humorous, but the background is way too bright compared to your subject', '2004-10-09 16:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(952039, 109571, 5354, '<td valign="top">very strange halo effect</td>', 'very strange halo effect', '2004-10-09 17:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(952042, 109789, 5354, '<td valign="top">Did you neat image this - all the feather detail has been lost</td>', 'Did you neat image this - all the feather detail has been lost', '2004-10-09 17:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(952056, 109577, 5354, '<td valign="top">very strange halo effect</td>', 'very strange halo effect', '2004-10-09 17:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(952212, 109462, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo!  Looks a tad oversharped, but what the hey, I''m jealous that you got such a great shot.  Definitely one of my favs.</td>', 'Very cool photo!  Looks a tad oversharped, but what the hey, I''m jealous that you got such a great shot.  Definitely one of my favs.', '2004-10-09 20:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(952223, 109615, 2553, '<td valign="top">WON-DER-FUL!!  The backlighting makes all the difference in this shot really giving it that "something unexpected" that makes it stand out.  There is still enough lighting on the body to be able to make out the details, and the catch-lights in the eyes really help define the face.  A terrific shot, and one of my few 10''s.</td>', 'WON-DER-FUL!!  The backlighting makes all the difference in this shot really giving it that "something unexpected" that makes it stand out.  There is still enough lighting on the body to be able to make out the details, and the catch-lights in the eyes really help define the face.  A terrific shot, and one of my few 10''s.', '2004-10-09 20:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(952225, 109570, 2553, '<td valign="top">A good capture of this little guy!  I would like to have seen more of his head in focus, but the eyes and beak are and that does draw  the eye right in to the center of his face.  Very nice.</td>', 'A good capture of this little guy!  I would like to have seen more of his head in focus, but the eyes and beak are and that does draw  the eye right in to the center of his face.  Very nice.', '2004-10-09 20:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(952230, 109143, 2553, '<td valign="top">My personal preference would have been to see this photo cropped down so that your subject took up the majority of the space.  For me, the background almost overwhelms the wonderful textures of the feathers, and the composition feels a little unbalanced.  Your lighting is excellent, really bringing out the details in the bird.</td>', 'My personal preference would have been to see this photo cropped down so that your subject took up the majority of the space.  For me, the background almost overwhelms the wonderful textures of the feathers, and the composition feels a little unbalanced.  Your lighting is excellent, really bringing out the details in the bird.', '2004-10-09 20:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(952240, 109587, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the beautiful colors, and it looks like your lighting was great.  A nicely done photo, but it lacks that "something extra" that would really make it jump out at me.</td>', 'I love the beautiful colors, and it looks like your lighting was great.  A nicely done photo, but it lacks that "something extra" that would really make it jump out at me.', '2004-10-09 20:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(952246, 109308, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, good composition and lighting.  I''m giving it a 9, but for it to have been a 10 for me, I would like to have seen one of two things:<br/>A tighter crop on the front bird, making it all about him, or...<br/>A composition fully including the birds at the top, so that they aren''t "chopped off".  <br/></td>', 'Beautiful colors, good composition and lighting.  I''m giving it a 9, but for it to have been a 10 for me, I would like to have seen one of two things:A tighter crop on the front bird, making it all about him, or...A composition fully including the birds at the top, so that they aren''t "chopped off".  ', '2004-10-09 20:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(952250, 109591, 2553, '<td valign="top">This looks like "zoo" habitat, not "natural" habitat, nevertheless, I like it a lot.  What amazing animals they are, and they provided you with a composition that is very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'This looks like "zoo" habitat, not "natural" habitat, nevertheless, I like it a lot.  What amazing animals they are, and they provided you with a composition that is very pleasing to the eye.', '2004-10-09 20:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(952256, 109789, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  If you got this shot in his "natural" environment, I want to know where your stalking grounds are!  Can''t get "our" eagles to be still for a moment.  Wonderful lighting and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful!  If you got this shot in his "natural" environment, I want to know where your stalking grounds are!  Can''t get "our" eagles to be still for a moment.  Wonderful lighting and composition.', '2004-10-09 20:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(952257, 109640, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, do you live in Africa?  A superb shot, with terrific lighting, and a very pleasing composition.</td>', 'Wow, do you live in Africa?  A superb shot, with terrific lighting, and a very pleasing composition.', '2004-10-09 20:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(952263, 109571, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the color (duotone?), but the "glow" behind the giraffe feels kind of "weird" to me, and it feels like this long neck and head are kind of just floating in the air.  I would really like to have seen some point of reference, like maybe a tree, or maybe another giraffe.</td>', 'I like the color (duotone?), but the "glow" behind the giraffe feels kind of "weird" to me, and it feels like this long neck and head are kind of just floating in the air.  I would really like to have seen some point of reference, like maybe a tree, or maybe another giraffe.', '2004-10-09 20:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(952268, 109643, 2553, '<td valign="top">V-e-r-y nice shot.  Actually one of my favorites in the challenge.  The lighting is excellent, lending an entirely different feel to this shot than all of the other "cat" photos.  The look on this cat''s face is stunning, it''s hard to stop looking at his(her?) eyes.  I''m guessing this isn''t a truly "natural" habitat shot, nevertheless, a phenomenal shot.  I''d be very proud of this were it me!</td>', 'V-e-r-y nice shot.  Actually one of my favorites in the challenge.  The lighting is excellent, lending an entirely different feel to this shot than all of the other "cat" photos.  The look on this cat''s face is stunning, it''s hard to stop looking at his(her?) eyes.  I''m guessing this isn''t a truly "natural" habitat shot, nevertheless, a phenomenal shot.  I''d be very proud of this were it me!', '2004-10-09 20:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(952270, 108583, 2553, '<td valign="top">An incredible capture in every aspect.</td>', 'An incredible capture in every aspect.', '2004-10-09 20:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(952272, 109577, 2553, '<td valign="top">Something about this shot feels "odd" to me, and yet I am drawn to look at it!  I love that the body is in good focus, but the wings show movement;  a very nice capture.</td>', 'Something about this shot feels "odd" to me, and yet I am drawn to look at it!  I love that the body is in good focus, but the wings show movement;  a very nice capture.', '2004-10-09 20:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(952276, 109546, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the b&amp;w definitely, and your capture of such a pensive expression is wonderful.  A catchlight in the eyes would have made it superb.</td>', 'Love the b&w definitely, and your capture of such a pensive expression is wonderful.  A catchlight in the eyes would have made it superb.', '2004-10-09 21:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(952279, 109341, 2553, '<td valign="top">Composition, lighting, and capture of expression are wonderful.  It''s the kind of shot that really draws you in and makes you wonder what was going on.</td>', 'Composition, lighting, and capture of expression are wonderful.  It''s the kind of shot that really draws you in and makes you wonder what was going on.', '2004-10-09 21:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(952286, 109484, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though I like this shot, and the composition is different enough to make it interesting, I would really love to see more of his face. Have to admit though that this angle is an unusual perspective and negative space aspect gives it impact.</td>', 'Though I like this shot, and the composition is different enough to make it interesting, I would really love to see more of his face. Have to admit though that this angle is an unusual perspective and negative space aspect gives it impact.', '2004-10-09 21:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
