(952393, 109734, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry with the reflection however I think some of the highlights are blown (feathers have no detail).  There is a slight sense of depth from the lines in the water however to get a stronger 3D effect there needs to be more detail in the background.  It might have worked showing the horizon.</td>', 'Nice symmetry with the reflection however I think some of the highlights are blown (feathers have no detail).  There is a slight sense of depth from the lines in the water however to get a stronger 3D effect there needs to be more detail in the background.  It might have worked showing the horizon.', '2004-10-09 23:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(952406, 109615, 7743, '<td valign="top">Great backlighting, catchlight in the eyes and detail all around.  You''ve even caught the dirt on the paws and nose.  My only suggestion would be to try and tone down the highlights on the right as some of them seem to be a bit blown. 9</td>', 'Great backlighting, catchlight in the eyes and detail all around.  You''ve even caught the dirt on the paws and nose.  My only suggestion would be to try and tone down the highlights on the right as some of them seem to be a bit blown. 9', '2004-10-09 23:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
