(952697, 109546, 7743, '<td valign="top">This works very well in black and white.  Contrast may need a bit of a boost in the center portion of the image around the head to bring out more detail around the right eye.  The left side of the face and the lower portion seems to be a bit over exposed.  7</td>', 'This works very well in black and white.  Contrast may need a bit of a boost in the center portion of the image around the head to bring out more detail around the right eye.  The left side of the face and the lower portion seems to be a bit over exposed.  7', '2004-10-10 11:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
