(953540, 108464, 16965, '<td valign="top">The wildlife must be pretty well hidden in all those flowers....</td>', 'The wildlife must be pretty well hidden in all those flowers....', '2004-10-11 00:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(953542, 109791, 6008, '<td valign="top">It looks like the focus was more on the tree behind the tiger as the head and body is a little soft in comparison. It also looks a little underexposed, probably due to the whiteness of the fur, which can be hard to expose right.</td>', 'It looks like the focus was more on the tree behind the tiger as the head and body is a little soft in comparison. It also looks a little underexposed, probably due to the whiteness of the fur, which can be hard to expose right.', '2004-10-11 00:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(953543, 109298, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and nice sharp image. I like the gleam on the head and the glint in his eye. The background is unobtrusive too and sets a nice scene. Excellent capture.</td>', 'Good lighting and nice sharp image. I like the gleam on the head and the glint in his eye. The background is unobtrusive too and sets a nice scene. Excellent capture.', '2004-10-11 00:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(953546, 108559, 6008, '<td valign="top">The lighting and exposure is good. The composition is lacking as the frog is central to the image, which makes it feel a little static. There is a lot of negative space at the top and bottom and he is looking out of the frame. Having it in landscape orientation and giving him room to look coud potentially improve the composition.</td>', 'The lighting and exposure is good. The composition is lacking as the frog is central to the image, which makes it feel a little static. There is a lot of negative space at the top and bottom and he is looking out of the frame. Having it in landscape orientation and giving him room to look coud potentially improve the composition.', '2004-10-11 00:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(953548, 109309, 16965, '<td valign="top">Incredibly vibrant colors!!!</td>', 'Incredibly vibrant colors!!!', '2004-10-11 00:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(953549, 108583, 21034, '<td valign="top">This one should ribbon. The soft focus on the bird''s body and the orange background are amazing.  Were you in a blind?</td>', 'This one should ribbon. The soft focus on the bird''s body and the orange background are amazing.  Were you in a blind?', '2004-10-11 00:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(953551, 109308, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very enticing shot. You got my 8 a half hr ago.</td>', 'A very enticing shot. You got my 8 a half hr ago.', '2004-10-11 00:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
