(953638, 108890, 17103, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to thank everyone for the very nice comments on this photo.  Ive posted some outtakes for anyone interested in seeing more pictures of this little guy.<br/> <br/>To answer some questions:  I used the Tamron 75-300mm 4-5.6 telephoto lens.  All the chipmunk shots were taken through my kitchen window and were reasonably sharp, but I was able to sharpen the scaled-down versions considerably in post-processing.  The reason the background is so nicely blurred is because the only thing behind the chipmunk is a stand of trees way off in the distance, not close enough to focus on.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=111227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17103/thumb/111227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17103/thumb/111227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17103/thumb/111227.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=111228" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17103/thumb/111228.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17103/thumb/111228.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17103/thumb/111228.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=111229" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17103/thumb/111229.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17103/thumb/111229.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17103/thumb/111229.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=111230" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17103/thumb/111230.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17103/thumb/111230.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17103/thumb/111230.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-11 00:25:27.</i></td>', 'I just wanted to thank everyone for the very nice comments on this photo.  Ive posted some outtakes for anyone interested in seeing more pictures of this little guy. To answer some questions:  I used the Tamron 75-300mm 4-5.6 telephoto lens.  All the chipmunk shots were taken through my kitchen window and were reasonably sharp, but I was able to sharpen the scaled-down versions considerably in post-processing.  The reason the background is so nicely blurred is because the only thing behind the chipmunk is a stand of trees way off in the distance, not close enough to focus on.       ', '2004-10-11 01:21:07.000000', '2004-10-11 01:25:27.000000', 0),
