(953714, 109294, 19936, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the comments. And yes the colors are real but I did add a little to the saturation.  As a zoo shot I did take this through glass into a natural enclosure.  He had wandered up and just sat down in front of me!  What luck.  I lost some focus due to the glass and had to get rid of some relection.  Wish I could have gotten rid of the noise also.  Maybe next time. Again, thanks for the comments.</td>', 'Thanks to all for the comments. And yes the colors are real but I did add a little to the saturation.  As a zoo shot I did take this through glass into a natural enclosure.  He had wandered up and just sat down in front of me!  What luck.  I lost some focus due to the glass and had to get rid of some relection.  Wish I could have gotten rid of the noise also.  Maybe next time. Again, thanks for the comments.', '2004-10-11 01:58:13.000000', NULL, 0),
