(953970, 109323, 16493, '<td valign="top">I feel that many of the voters are bit/alot narrow minded.<br/>For example, you can find wild horses and domesticated horses.<br/> <br/>Details: For the purpose of this challenge, "wildlife" should be considered non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment. Now that you know what to photograph, take your best shot!<br/> <br/>Humans are mammals, human kids have been found in the wild raised by nature and are by definition a wild mammal.<br/>There is a movie by ''François Truffaut'' that GeneralIE reminded me of that I saw long time about excalcy this.<br/> <br/>...and before I get some comments about the environment it says<br/>''living in a natural environment'' not ''in it''s natural environment'' so any zoo or palce having a natural looking environment and not a fence or bars is good enough to pas for the challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-12 10:55:53.</i></td>', 'I feel that many of the voters are bit/alot narrow minded.For example, you can find wild horses and domesticated horses. Details: For the purpose of this challenge, "wildlife" should be considered non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment. Now that you know what to photograph, take your best shot! Humans are mammals, human kids have been found in the wild raised by nature and are by definition a wild mammal.There is a movie by ''François Truffaut'' that GeneralIE reminded me of that I saw long time about excalcy this. ...and before I get some comments about the environment it says''living in a natural environment'' not ''in it''s natural environment'' so any zoo or palce having a natural looking environment and not a fence or bars is good enough to pas for the challenge.', '2004-10-11 05:12:25.000000', '2004-10-12 11:55:53.000000', 0),
